msgid ""
"Converts <link=\"WATER\">Water</link> into <link=\"OXYGEN\">Oxygen</link> and <link=\"HYDROGEN\">Hydrogen Gas</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Becomes idle when the area reaches maximum pressure capacity."
msgstr ""
" ﻝﻮﺤﻳ<link=\"WATER\">ﺀﺎﻤﻟﺍ</link> ﻰﻟﺇ <link=\"OXYGEN\">ﻦﻴﺠﺴﻛﻷﺍ</link> ﻭ <link=\"HYDROGEN\">ﻦﻴﺟﻭﺭﺪﻴﻬﻟﺍ ﺯﺎﻏ</link>.\n"
"\n"
