msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.FARMSTATION.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Produces <link=\"FARMSTATIONTOOLS\">Micronutrient Fertilizer</link> to increase <link=\"PLANTS\">Plant</link> growth rates.\n"
"\n"
"Assigned Duplicants must possess the <link=\"FARMING2\">Crop Tending</link> trait.\n"
"\n"
"This building is a necessary component of the Greenhouse room."
msgstr ""
" ﺞﺘﻨﻳ<link=\"FARMSTATIONTOOLS\">ﺔﻘﻴﻗﺪﻟﺍ ﺕﺎﻳﺬﻐﻤﻟﺍ ﺓﺪﻤﺳﺃ</link> ﻮﻤﻧ ﺕﻻﺪﻌﻣ ﺓﺩﺎﻳﺰﻟ <link=\"PLANTS\">ﺕﺎﺗﺎﺒﻨﻟﺍ</link>.\n"
"\n"
" ﺔﻤﺳ ﻦﻴﺼﺼﺨﻤﻟﺍ ﺦﺴﻨﻟﺍ ﻚﻠﺘﻤﻳ ﻥﺃ ﺐﺠﻳ<link=\"FARMING2\">ﻞﻴﺻﺎﺤﻤﻟﺎﺑ ﺔﻳﺎﻨﻌﻟﺍ</link>.\n"
"\n"
".ﺔﺌﻴﻓﺪﻟﺍ ﺔﻓﺮﻏ ﻲﻓ ﻱﺭﻭﺮﺿ ﺮﺼﻨﻋ ﻮﻫ ﻰﻨﺒﻤﻟﺍ ﺍﺬﻫ"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.FARMSTATION.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"FARMSTATION\">Farm Station</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"FARMSTATION\">ﺔﻋﺭﺰﻤﻟﺍ ﺔﻄﺤﻣ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.FARMTILE.DESC"
msgid ""
"Duplicants can deliver fertilizer and liquids to farm tiles, accelerating "
"plant growth."
msgstr ""
".ﺕﺎﺗﺎﺒﻨﻟﺍ ﻮﻤﻧ ﻉﺮﺴﻳ ﺎﻤﻣ ،ﺔﻋﺭﺰﻤﻟﺍ ﺕﺎﻌﺑﺮﻣ ﻰﻟﺇ ﻞﺋﺍﻮﺴﻟﺍﻭ ﺩﺎﻤﺴﻟﺍ ﻢﻴﻠﺴﺗ ﺦﺴﻨﻠﻟ ﻦﻜﻤﻳ"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.FARMTILE.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Grows one <link=\"PLANTS\">Plant</link> from a <link=\"PLANTS\">Seed</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Can be used as floor tile and rotated before construction."
msgstr ""
" ﻉﺭﺰﻳ<link=\"PLANTS\">ﺔﺘﺒﻧ</link> ﻦﻣ ﺓﺪﺣﺍﻭ <link=\"PLANTS\">ﺓﺭﺬﺑ</link>.\n"
"\n"
".ﺀﺎﻨﺒﻟﺍ ﻞﺒﻗ ﻪﺒﻠﻗﻭ ﺔﻴﺿﺭﺄﻛ ﻪﻣﺍﺪﺨﺘﺳﺍ ﻦﻜﻤﻳ"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.FARMTILE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"FARMTILE\">Farm Tile</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"FARMTILE\">ﺔﻋﺭﺰﻤﻟﺍ ﺔﻃﻼﺑ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.FERTILIZERMAKER.DESC"
msgid ""
"Fertilizer synthesizers convert polluted dirt into fertilizer for domestic "
"plants."
msgstr ".ﺔﻴﻟﺰﻨﻤﻟﺍ ﺕﺎﺗﺎﺒﻨﻠﻟ ﺩﺎﻤﺳ ﻰﻟﺇ ﺔﺛﻮﻠﻤﻟﺍ ﺔﺑﺮﺘﻟﺍ ﻝﻮﺤﺗ ﺓﺪﻤﺳﻷﺍ ﺕﻼﻠﺤﻣ"

