msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MODULARLAUNCHPADPORTLIQUID.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Loads <link=\"ELEMENTSLIQUID\">Liquids</link> to the storage of a linked rocket.\n"
"\n"
"Automatically links when built to the side of a <link=\"LAUNCHPAD\">Rocket Platform</link> or another <link=\"MODULARLAUNCHPADPORTSOLID\">Rocket Port</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Uses the liquid filters set on the rocket's cargo bays."
