"<link=\"REMOTEWORKERDOCK\">Remote Worker Docks</link> deploy automatons that operate machinery based on instructions received from a connected <link=\"REMOTEWORKTERMINAL\">Remote Controller</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Must be placed within range of its target building."
