msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.WALLTOILET.DESC"
msgid ""
"Wall Toilets transmit fewer germs to Duplicants and require no emptying."
msgstr ""
".ﻎﻳﺮﻔﺘﻟﺍ ﻡﺪﻋ ﻰﻟﺇ ﺝﺎﺘﺤﺗﻭ ﺦﺴﻨﻟﺍ ﻰﻟﺇ ﻢﻴﺛﺍﺮﺠﻟﺍ ﻦﻣ ﻞﻗﺃ ﺍﺩﺪﻋ ﺔﻳﺭﺍﺪﺠﻟﺍ ﺾﻴﺣﺍﺮﻤﻟﺍ "
"ﻞﻘﻨﺗ"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.WALLTOILET.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Gives Duplicants a place to relieve themselves. Empties directly on the other side of the wall.\n"
"\n"
"Spreads very few <link=\"DISEASE\">Germs</link>."
msgstr ""
".ﺭﺍﺪﺠﻟﺍ ﻦﻣ ﺮﺧﻵﺍ ﺐﻧﺎﺠﻟﺍ ﻰﻠﻋ ﺓﺮﺷﺎﺒﻣ ﻍﺮﻔﻳ .ﻢﻬﺘﺟﺎﺣ ﺀﺎﻀﻘﻟ ﺎﻧﺎﻜﻣ ﺦﺴﻨﻠﻟ ﺮﻓﻮﻳ\n"
" ﻦﻣ ﺍﺪﺟ ﻼﻴﻠﻗ ﺍﺩﺪﻋ ﺮﺸﻨﻳ<link=\"DISEASE\">ﻢﻴﺛﺍﺮﺠﻟﺍ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.WALLTOILET.NAME"
