"Sent Higby and Tayeh out to investigate reported issues with debris shield sensors. Everything's copacetic. Must be something on the Terra side.\n"
"\n"
"Gossmann patched in at the end of the call. In a real <i>mood</i>. She's been assigned a solo mission. Somewhere \"colder than the Director's heart.\" I didn't even know anything <i>could</i> upset her. Even when we were stranded on the space station for almost a year, she was cracking jokes.\n"
"\n"
"Whatever it is, it's gotta be a step down from the CSC initiative. This is the first time all three major spacefaring corporations are collaborating. We're making histor-\n"
"\n"
"-stand by, the orbit control system is glitc-\n"
"\n"
"-what in the world is th-\n"
"\n"
"-oh my g-\n"
"\n"
"HIGBY!\n"
"\n"
"------------------\n"
