msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.PACU.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"The Pacu fish is often interpreted as possessing a vacant stare due to its "
"large and unblinking eyes, yet they are remarkably bright and friendly "
"creatures."
