msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.RADIATION.PARAGRAPH_1"
msgid ""
"When transporting radioactive materials such as <link=\"URANIUMORE\">Uranium Ore</link>, care must be taken to avoid exposing outside objects to <link=\"RADIATIONSICKNESS\">Radioactive Contaminants</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Using proper transportation vessels, such as those which are lined with <link=\"LEAD\">Lead</link>, is crucial to ensuring that Duplicants avoid <link=\"RADIATIONSICKNESS\">Radiation Sickness</link>.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" ﻞﺜﻣ ﺔﻌﺸﻤﻟﺍ ﺩﺍﻮﻤﻟﺍ ﻞﻘﻧ ﺪﻨﻋ<link=\"URANIUMORE\">ﻡﻮﻴﻧﺍﺭﻮﻴﻟﺍ ﺕﺎﻣﺎﺧ</link>ﻝ ﺔﻴﺟﺭﺎﺨﻟﺍ ﺀﺎﻴﺷﻷﺍ ﺽﺮﻌﺗ ﺐﻨﺠﺘﻟ ﺭﺬﺤﻟﺍ ﻲﺧﻮﺗ ﺐﺠﻳ ،<link=\"RADIATIONSICKNESS\">ﻉﺎﻌﺷﻹﺎﺑ ﺔﺛﻮﻠﻤﻟﺍ ﺩﺍﻮﻤﻟﺍ</link>.\n"
"\n"
"ـﺑ ﺔﻨﻄﺒﻤﻟﺍ ﻚﻠﺗ ﻞﺜﻣ ،ﺔﺒﺳﺎﻨﻤﻟﺍ ﻞﻘﻨﻟﺍ ﻞﺋﺎﺳﻭ ﻡﺍﺪﺨﺘﺳﺍ<link=\"LEAD\">ﺹﺎﺻﺮﻟﺍ</link>ـﺑ ﺔﺑﺎﺻﻺﻟ ﺦﺴﻨﻟﺍ ﺐﻨﺠﺗ ﻥﺎﻤﻀﻟ ﺔﻴﻤﻫﻷﺍ ﻎﻟﺎﺑ ﺮﻣﺃ ،<link=\"RADIATIONSICKNESS\">ﻉﺎﻌﺷﻹﺍ ﺽﺮﻣ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.RADIATION.PARAGRAPH_2"
msgid ""
"Duplicants who are exposed to <link=\"RADIATIONSICKNESS\">Radioactive Contaminants</link> will need to wear protection or they risk coming down with <link=\"RADIATIONSICKNESS\">Radiation Sickness</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Some Duplicants will have more of a natural resistance to radiation, but prolonged exposure will still increase their chances of becoming sick.\n"
"\n"
"Consuming <link=\"BASICRADPILL\">Rad Pills</link> or seafood such as <link=\"COOKEDFISH\">Cooked Seafood</link> or <link=\"SEALETTUCE\">Waterweed</link> increases a Duplicant's radiation resistance, but will not cure a Duplicant's <link=\"RADIATIONSICKNESS\">Radiation Sickness</link> once they have become infected.\n"
"\n"
"On the other hand, exposure to radiation will kill <link=\"FOODPOISONING\">Food Poisoning</link>, <link=\"SLIMELUNG\">Slimelung</link> and <link=\"ZOMBIESPORES\">Zombie Spores</link> on surfaces (including on Duplicants).\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" ـﻟ ﻥﻮﺿﺮﻌﺘﻳ ﻦﻳﺬﻟﺍ ﻥﻭﺭﺮﻜﻤﻟﺍ ﺝﺎﺘﺤﻴﺳ<link=\"RADIATIONSICKNESS\">ﺔﻴﻋﺎﻌﺷﻹﺍ ﺕﺎﺛﻮﻠﻤﻟﺍ</link> ـﺑ ﺔﺑﺎﺻﻹﺎﺑ ﻥﻭﺮﻃﺎﺨﻳ ﻢﻬﻧﺈﻓ ﻻﺇﻭ ﺔﻳﺎﻤﺤﻟﺍ ﺀﺍﺪﺗﺭﺍ ﻰﻟﺇ <link=\"RADIATIONSICKNESS\">ﻉﺎﻌﺷﻹﺍ ﺀﺍﺩ</link>.\n"
"\n"
".ﻢﻬﺿﺮﻣ ﺔﻴﻟﺎﻤﺘﺣﺍ ﻦﻣ ﺪﻳﺰﻴﺳ ﻝﻮﻄﻤﻟﺍ ﺽﺮﻌﺘﻟﺍ ﻦﻜﻟ ،ﻉﺎﻌﺷﻺﻟ ﺮﺒﻛﺃ ﺔﻴﻌﻴﺒﻃ ﺔﻣﻭﺎﻘﻣ ﻢﻬﻳﺪﻟ ﻥﻮﻜﻴﺳ ﻦﻳﺭﺮﻜﻤﻟﺍ ﺾﻌﺑ\n"
"\n"
" ﻙﻼﻬﺘﺳﺍ<link=\"BASICRADPILL\">ﺩﺍﺮﻟﺍ ﺹﺍﺮﻗﺃ</link> ﻞﺜﻣ ﺔﻳﺮﺤﺒﻟﺍ ﺕﻻﻮﻛﺄﻤﻟﺍ ﻭﺃ <link=\"COOKEDFISH\">ﺔﺧﻮﺒﻄﻤﻟﺍ ﺔﻳﺮﺤﺒﻟﺍ ﺕﻻﻮﻛﺄﻤﻟﺍ</link> ﻭﺃ <link=\"SEALETTUCE\">ﺮﺤﺒﻟﺍ ﺐﺸﻋ</link> ﺞﻟﺎﻌﻳ ﻦﻟ ﻪﻨﻜﻟ ،ﻉﺎﻌﺷﻺﻟ ﺭﺮﻜﻤﻟﺍ ﺔﻣﻭﺎﻘﻣ ﻦﻣ ﺪﻳﺰﻳ <link=\"RADIATIONSICKNESS\">ﻉﺎﻌﺷﻹﺍ ﺀﺍﺩ</link>.ﻪﺘﺑﺎﺻﺇ ﺩﺮﺠﻤﺑ ﺭﺮﻜﻤﻟﺍ ﻯﺪﻟ \n"
"\n"
" ﻞﺘﻘﻴﺳ ﻉﺎﻌﺷﻺﻟ ﺽﺮﻌﺘﻟﺍ ،ﻯﺮﺧﺃ ﺔﻴﺣﺎﻧ ﻦﻣ<link=\"FOODPOISONING\">ﻲﺋﺍﺬﻐﻟﺍ ﻢﻤﺴﺘﻟﺍ</link>، <link=\"SLIMELUNG\">ﻲﻃﺎﺨﻤﻟﺍ ﺔﺋﺮﻟﺍ ﺏﺎﻬﺘﻟﺍ</link> ﻭ <link=\"ZOMBIESPORES\">ﻲﺒﻣﻭﺰﻟﺍ ﻢﻴﺛﺍﺮﺟ</link>.(ﻦﻳﺭﺮﻜﻤﻟﺍ ﻰﻠﻋ ﻚﻟﺫ ﻲﻓ ﺎﻤﺑ) ﺢﻄﺳﻷﺍ ﻰﻠﻋ "

msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.RADIATION.PARAGRAPH_3"
msgid ""
"A <link=\"NUCLEARREACTOR\">Research Reactor</link> will require <link=\"ENRICHEDURANIUM\">Enriched Uranium</link> to run. Uranium can be enriched using a <link=\"URANIUMCENTRIFUGE\">Uranium Centrifuge</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Once supplied with <link=\"ENRICHEDURANIUM\">Enriched Uranium</link>, a <link=\"NUCLEARREACTOR\">Research Reactors</link> will create an enormous amount of <link=\"HEAT\">Heat</link> which can then be placed under a source of <link=\"WATER\">Water</link> to produce <link=\"STEAM\">Steam</link>and connected to a <link=\"STEAMTURBINE2\">Steam Turbine</link> to produce a considerable source of <link=\"POWER\">Power</link>.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" ﺝﺎﺘﺤﻴﺳ<link=\"NUCLEARREACTOR\">ﻲﺜﺤﺒﻟﺍ ﻞﻋﺎﻔﻤﻟﺍ</link> ﻰﻟﺇ <link=\"ENRICHEDURANIUM\">ﺐﺼﺨﻤﻟﺍ ﻡﻮﻴﻧﺍﺭﻮﻴﻟﺍ</link> ﻡﺍﺪﺨﺘﺳﺎﺑ ﻡﻮﻴﻧﺍﺭﻮﻴﻟﺍ ﺐﻴﺼﺨﺗ ﻦﻜﻤﻳ .ﻞﻤﻌﻠﻟ <link=\"URANIUMCENTRIFUGE\">ﻡﻮﻴﻧﺍﺭﻮﻴﻠﻟ ﻱﺰﻛﺮﻣ ﺩﺮﻃ</link>.\n"
"\n"
" ـﺑ ﻩﺪﻳﻭﺰﺗ ﺩﺮﺠﻤﺑ<link=\"ENRICHEDURANIUM\">ﺐﺼﺨﻤﻟﺍ ﻡﻮﻴﻧﺍﺭﻮﻴﻟﺍ</link> ﺞﺘﻨﺘﺳ ،<link=\"NUCLEARREACTOR\">ﺔﻴﺜﺤﺒﻟﺍ ﺕﻼﻋﺎﻔﻤﻟﺍ</link> ﻦﻣ ﺔﻠﺋﺎﻫ ﺔﻴﻤﻛ <link=\"HEAT\">ﺓﺭﺍﺮﺤﻟﺍ</link> ﻦﻣ ﺭﺪﺼﻣ ﺖﺤﺗ ﺎﻬﻌﺿﻭ ﻦﻜﻤﻳ ﻲﺘﻟﺍﻭ <link=\"WATER\">ﺀﺎﻤﻟﺍ</link> ﺝﺎﺘﻧﻹ <link=\"STEAM\">ﺭﺎﺨﺒﻟﺍ</link> ـﺑ ﻪﻄﺑﺭﻭ <link=\"STEAMTURBINE2\">ﻱﺭﺎﺨﺑ ﻦﻴﺑﺭﻮﺗ</link> ﻦﻣ ﺮﻴﺒﻛ ﺭﺪﺼﻣ ﺝﺎﺘﻧﻹ <link=\"POWER\">ﺔﻗﺎﻄﻟﺍ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.RADIATION.PARAGRAPH_4"
msgid ""
"To learn more, see <link=\"MISCELLANEOUSTIPS19\">Tutorial: Radiation</link>.\n"
"\n"
msgstr " ﺮﻈﻧﺍ ،ﺪﻳﺰﻤﻟﺍ ﻢﻠﻌﺘﻟ<link=\"MISCELLANEOUSTIPS19\">ﻉﺎﻌﺷﻹﺍ :ﺱﻭﺭﺪﻟﺍ</link>."

