msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.ROOM_REQUIREMENT_CLASS.DECORATION.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Buildings that give the colony a valuable aesthetic boost, and allow Duplicants to express themselves creatively.\n"
"\n"
"Some decor buildings will only be counted as such if they have been appropriately fulfilled. For example, uncarved sculpting blocks and blank canvases do not contribute to a room's status."
msgstr ""
