msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.SAGE.BODY.CONTAINER2"
msgid ""
"It is difficult to classify the Hatch's diet as the term \"omnivore\" does not extend to the non-organic materials it is capable of ingesting.\n"
"\n"
"A more appropriate term is \"totumvore\", given that it can consume and find nutritional value in nearly every known substance."
