msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.CRITTER_MANIPULATOR.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Explore a revolutionary genetic manipulation device designed for critters.\n"
"\n"
"Whether or not it was ever used on non-critter subjects is unclear. Its DNA database has been wiped clean."
