msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.ALGAE_STEGO.BABY.DESC"
msgid ""
"A slightly moist Blum Lumb baby.\n"
"\n"
"In time, it will grow into a stompy <link=\"ALGAESTEGO\">Blum Lumb</link>."
msgstr ""
".ﻼﻴﻠﻗ ﺐﻃﺭ ﺐﻣﻻ ﻡﻮﻠﺑ ﻞﻔﻃ\n"
"\n"
" ﻢﺨﺿ ﺐﻣﻻ ﻡﻮﻠﺑ ﺢﺒﺼﻴﻟ ﻮﻤﻨﻴﺳ ،ﺖﻗﻮﻟﺍ ﺭﻭﺮﻣ ﻊﻣ<link=\"ALGAESTEGO\">Blum Lumb</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.ALGAE_STEGO.BABY.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"ALGAESTEGO\">Blumblet</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"ALGAESTEGO\">ﺖﻴﻠﺒﻣﻮﻠﺑ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.ALGAE_STEGO.DESC"
msgid ""
"Blum Lumbs are non-hostile critters that produce <link=\"ALGAE\">Algae</link>.\n"
"\n"
"When they stomp heavily near <link=\"PLANTS\">plants</link>, the commotion causes harvestable items to fall to the ground."
msgstr ""
" ﺞﺘﻨﺗ ﺔﻴﺋﺍﺪﻋ ﺮﻴﻏ ﺕﺎﻗﻮﻠﺨﻣ ﻲﻫ ﺲﺒﻣﻮﻟ ﻡﻮﻠﺑ<link=\"ALGAE\">ﺐﻟﺎﺤﻄﻟﺍ</link>.\n"
"\n"
" ﻦﻣ ﺏﺮﻘﻟﺎﺑ ﺓﻮﻘﺑ ﻥﻮﺳﻭﺪﻳ ﺎﻣﺪﻨﻋ<link=\"PLANTS\">ﺕﺎﺗﺎﺒﻨﻟﺍ</link>.ﺽﺭﻷﺍ ﻰﻠﻋ ﺩﺎﺼﺤﻠﻟ ﺔﻠﺑﺎﻘﻟﺍ ﺮﺻﺎﻨﻌﻟﺍ ﻁﻮﻘﺳ ﺞﻴﺠﻀﻟﺍ ﺐﺒﺴﻳ ،"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.ALGAE_STEGO.EGG_NAME"
msgid "<link=\"ALGAESTEGO\">Blum Lumb Egg</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"ALGAESTEGO\">ﻎﻳﺇ ﺐﻣﻮﻟ ﻡﻮﻠﺑ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.ALGAE_STEGO.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"ALGAESTEGO\">Blum Lumb</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"ALGAESTEGO\">ﺐﻣﻮﻟ ﻡﻮﻠﺑ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BASICFABRICMATERIALPLANT.DESC"
msgid ""
"Thimble Reeds produce indescribably soft <link=\"BASICFABRIC\">Reed "
"Fiber</link> for <link=\"EQUIPMENT\">Clothing</link> production."
msgstr ""
" ﺓﺮﻴﻐﺼﻟﺍ ﺐﺼﻘﻟﺍ ﺕﺎﺗﺎﺒﻧ ﺞﺘﻨﺗ<link=\"BASICFABRIC\">ﺐﺼﻘﻟﺍ ﻑﺎﻴﻟﺃ</link> ﺝﺎﺘﻧﻹ "
"ﻒﺻﻮﻳ ﻻ ﻞﻜﺸﺑ ﺔﻤﻋﺎﻨﻟﺍ <link=\"EQUIPMENT\">ﺲﺑﻼﻤﻟﺍ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BASICFABRICMATERIALPLANT.DOMESTICATEDDESC"
msgid "This plant produces <link=\"BASICFABRIC\">Reed Fiber</link>."
msgstr " ﺞﺘﻨﻳ ﺕﺎﺒﻨﻟﺍ ﺍﺬﻫ<link=\"BASICFABRIC\">ﺐﺼﻘﻟﺍ ﻑﺎﻴﻟﺃ</link>."

