msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BUTTERFLY.DESC"
msgid ""
"Mimikas are airborne organisms that help nearby <link=\"PLANTS\">Plants</link> grow more quickly.\n"
"\n"
"When its leaves dry up, it will harden into <link=\"BUTTERFLYPLANTSEED\">Mimillet</link>."
msgstr ""
" ﺪﻋﺎﺴﺗ ﺔﻳﻮﺟ ﺕﺎﻨﺋﺎﻛ ﻲﻫ ﺕﺎﺴﻜﻴﻤﻴﻤﻟﺍ<link=\"PLANTS\">ﺕﺎﺗﺎﺒﻨﻟﺍ</link>.ﺮﺒﻛﺃ ﺔﻋﺮﺴﺑ ﻮﻤﻨﻟﺍ ﻰﻠﻋ ﺔﺒﻳﺮﻘﻟﺍ \n"
"\n"
" ﻰﻟﺇ ﻝﻮﺤﺘﻴﺳ ،ﻪﻗﺍﺭﻭﺃ ﻒﺠﺗ ﺎﻣﺪﻨﻋ<link=\"BUTTERFLYPLANTSEED\">ﺖﻴﻠﻴﻤﻴﻣ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BUTTERFLY.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BUTTERFLY\">Mimika</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BUTTERFLY\">ﺎﻜﻴﻤﻴﻣ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BUTTERFLYPLANT.DESC"
msgid ""
"Mimika Buds are self-harvesting plants that produce airborne <link=\"BUTTERFLY\">Mimikas</link>.\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"BUTTERFLY\">Mimikas</link> boost growth for nearby <link=\"PLANTS\">Plants</link> before hardening into <link=\"BUTTERFLYPLANTSEED\">Mimillet</link>."
msgstr ""
" ﺞﺘﻨﺗﻭ ﻲﺗﺍﺬﻟﺍ ﺪﺼﺤﻟﺎﺑ ﻡﻮﻘﺗ ﺕﺎﺗﺎﺒﻧ ﻲﻫ ﺎﻜﻴﻤﻴﻣ ﺭﺎﻫﺯﺃ<link=\"BUTTERFLY\">ﺱﺎﻜﻴﻤﻴﻣ</link>.ﺍﻮﺟ ﺔﻟﻮﻤﺤﻤﻟﺍ \n"
"\n"
"<link=\"BUTTERFLY\">ﺱﺎﻜﻴﻤﻴﻣ</link> ﺕﺎﺗﺎﺒﻨﻠﻟ ﻮﻤﻨﻟﺍ ﺯﺰﻌﺗ <link=\"PLANTS\">ﺔﺒﻳﺮﻘﻟﺍ</link> ﻰﻟﺇ ﺐﻠﺼﺘﺗ ﻥﺃ ﻞﺒﻗ <link=\"BUTTERFLYPLANTSEED\">ﺖﻴﻠﻴﻤﻴﻣ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.BUTTERFLYPLANT.DOMESTICATEDDESC"
msgid "This plant produces <link=\"BUTTERFLY\">Mimikas</link>."
msgstr " ﺞﺘﻨﻳ ﺕﺎﺒﻨﻟﺍ ﺍﺬﻫ<link=\"BUTTERFLY\">ﺱﺎﻜﻴﻤﻴﻣ</link>."

