msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.COLDWHEAT.DESC"
msgid ""
"Sleet Wheat produces <link=\"COLDWHEATSEED\">Sleet Wheat Grain</link>, a "
"chilly grain that can be processed into <link=\"FOOD\">Food</link>."
