msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.ICEBELLY.DESC"
msgid ""
"Bammoths are lumbering, nonhostile creatures that subsist on <link=\"CARROT\">Plume Squash</link>, <link=\"BEANPLANTSEED\">Nosh Beans</link> and <link=\"FRIESCARROT\">Squash Fries</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Their thick overcoats can be shorn for <link=\"BASICFABRIC\">Reed Fiber</link>."
msgstr ""
" ﻰﻠﻋ ﻯﺬﻐﺘﺗ ﺔﻴﻧﺍﻭﺪﻋ ﺮﻴﻏﻭ ﺔﺌﻴﻄﺑ ﺕﺎﻗﻮﻠﺨﻣ ﻲﻫ ﺙﻮﻣﺎﺒﻟﺍ<link=\"CARROT\">ﺔﺸﻳﺮﻟﺍ ﻉﺮﻗ</link>، <link=\"BEANPLANTSEED\">ﺵﻮﻧ ﺎﻴﻟﻮﺻﺎﻓ</link> ﻭ <link=\"FRIESCARROT\">ﺔﻴﻠﻘﻤﻟﺍ ﻉﺮﻘﻟﺍ ﺢﺋﺍﺮﺷ</link>.\n"
"\n"
" ﻰﻠﻋ ﻝﻮﺼﺤﻠﻟ ﺔﻜﻴﻤﺴﻟﺍ ﺎﻬﻔﻃﺎﻌﻣ ﻖﻠﺣ ﻦﻜﻤﻳ<link=\"BASICFABRIC\">ﺐﺼﻘﻟﺍ ﻑﺎﻴﻟﺃ</link>."

