msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.MOLE.BABY.DESC"
msgid ""
"A snuggly little pup.\n"
"\n"
"One day it will grow into an adult <link=\"MOLE\">Shove Vole</link>."
msgstr ""
".ﺩﻭﺩﻭ ﺮﻴﻐﺻ ﻭﺮﺟ\n"
"\n"
" ﺢﺒﺼﻴﻟ ﻮﻤﻨﻴﺳ ﻡﺎﻳﻷﺍ ﻦﻣ ﻡﻮﻳ ﻲﻓ<link=\"MOLE\">ﻝﻮﻓ ﻑﻮﺷ</link>.ﻎﻟﺎﺑ "

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.MOLE.BABY.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MOLE\">Vole Pup</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MOLE\">ﺪﻠﺨﻟﺍ ﻭﺮﺟ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.MOLE.DESC"
msgid ""
"Shove Voles are burrowing critters that eat the <link=\"REGOLITH\">Regolith</link> collected on terrestrial surfaces.\n"
"\n"
"They cannot burrow through <link=\"REFINEDMETAL\">Refined Metals</link>."
msgstr ""
" ﻰﻠﻋ ﻯﺬﻐﺘﻳﻭ ﺭﻮﺤﺠﻟﺍ ﺮﻔﺤﻳ ﻥﺍﻮﻴﺣ ﻮﻫ ﻊﻓﺍﺪﻟﺍ ﺪﻠﺨﻟﺍ<link=\"REGOLITH\">ﻱﺮﺨﺼﻟﺍ ﻑﻼﻐﻟﺍ</link>.ﺔﻴﺿﺭﻷﺍ ﺢﻄﺳﻷﺍ ﻰﻠﻋ ﻪﻌﻤﺟ ﻢﺘﻳ ﻱﺬﻟﺍ \n"
"\n"
" ﺮﺒﻋ ﺮﻔﺤﻟﺍ ﻪﻨﻜﻤﻳ ﻻ<link=\"REFINEDMETAL\">ﺓﺭﺮﻜﻤﻟﺍ ﻥﺩﺎﻌﻤﻟﺍ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.MOLE.EGG_NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MOLE\">Shove Vole Egg</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MOLE\">ﺪﻠﺨﻟﺍ ﺔﻀﻴﺑ ﻊﻓﺩﺍ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.MOLE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MOLE\">Shove Vole</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MOLE\">ﺭﻮﺑﺪﻟﺍ ﺪﻠﺧ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.MOLE.VARIANT_DELICACY.BABY.DESC"
msgid ""
"A tender little Delecta Vole pup.\n"
"\n"
"One day it will grow into an adult Shove Vole morph, the <link=\"MOLEDELICACY\">Delecta Vole</link>."
msgstr ""
".ﻰﺘﻜﻴﻠﻳﺩ ﻥﺍﺮﺌﻓ ﻦﻣ ﻖﻴﻗﺭ ﺮﻴﻐﺻ ﻭﺮﺟ\n"
"\n"
" ،ﻑﻮﺷ ﻥﺍﺮﺌﻓ ﻦﻣ ﺎﻐﻟﺎﺑ ﻼﻜﺷ ﺢﺒﺼﻴﻟ ﻮﻤﻨﻴﺳ ﻡﺎﻳﻷﺍ ﻦﻣ ﻡﻮﻳ ﻲﻓ<link=\"MOLEDELICACY\">ﻰﺘﻜﻴﻠﻳﺩ ﺭﺄﻓ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.MOLE.VARIANT_DELICACY.BABY.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MOLEDELICACY\">Delecta Vole Pup</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MOLEDELICACY\">ﻲﺘﻜﻴﻠﻳﺩ ﻝﻮﻓ ﻭﺮﺟ ﻊﺘﻤﺘﻳ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.MOLE.VARIANT_DELICACY.DESC"
msgid ""
"Delecta Voles are burrowing critters whose bodies sprout shearable <link=\"GINGERCONFIG\">Tonic Root</link> when <link=\"REGOLITH\">Regolith</link> is ingested at preferred temperatures.\n"
"\n"
"They cannot burrow through <link=\"REFINEDMETAL\">Refined Metals</link>."
msgstr ""
" ﺭﻭﺬﺟ ﻪﻣﺎﺴﺟﺃ ﻮﻤﻨﺗ ،ﺽﺭﻷﺍ ﺮﻔﺤﻳ ﻕﻮﻠﺨﻣ ﻮﻫ ﺎﺘﮑﻠﻳﺪﻟﺍ ﺭﺄﻓ<link=\"GINGERCONFIG\">ﻚﻴﻧﻮﺗ</link> ﻝﻭﺎﻨﺗ ﻢﺘﻳ ﺎﻣﺪﻨﻋ ﺺﻘﻠﻟ ﺔﻠﺑﺎﻗ <link=\"REGOLITH\">ﺔﺑﺮﺘﻠﻟ ﺔﻴﺤﻄﺴﻟﺍ ﺔﻘﺒﻄﻟﺍ</link>.ﺔﻠﻀﻔﻤﻟﺍ ﺓﺭﺍﺮﺤﻟﺍ ﺕﺎﺟﺭﺩ ﻲﻓ \n"
"\n"
" ﺮﺒﻋ ﺮﻔﺤﻟﺍ ﻢﻬﻨﻜﻤﻳ ﻻ<link=\"REFINEDMETAL\">ﺓﺭﺮﻜﻤﻟﺍ ﻥﺩﺎﻌﻤﻟﺍ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.MOLE.VARIANT_DELICACY.EGG_NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MOLEDELICACY\">Delecta Vole Egg</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MOLEDELICACY\">ﻝﻮﻓ ﺎﭩﻜﻴﻠﻳﺩ ﺔﻀﻴﺑ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.MOLE.VARIANT_DELICACY.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MOLEDELICACY\">Delecta Vole</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MOLEDELICACY\">ﺎﺘﻜﻴﻠﻳﺩ ﻝﻮﻓ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.MOO.DESC"
msgid ""
"Moos are extraterrestrial critters that feed on <link=\"GASGRASS\">Gas Grass</link> and excrete <link=\"METHANE\">Natural Gas</link>.\n"
"\n"
"When domesticated and fed, they can be milked for <link=\"MILK\">Brackene</link>."
msgstr ""
" ﻰﻠﻋ ﻯﺬﻐﺘﺗ ﺔﻴﺋﺎﻀﻓ ﺕﺎﻗﻮﻠﺨﻣ ﻲﻫ ﺱﻮﻤﻟﺍ<link=\"GASGRASS\">ﺯﺎﻐﻟﺍ ﺐﺸﻋ</link> ﺯﺮﻔﺗﻭ <link=\"METHANE\">ﻲﻌﻴﺒﻄﻟﺍ ﺯﺎﻐﻟﺍ</link>.\n"
"\n"
" ﻞﺟﺃ ﻦﻣ ﺎﻬﺒﻠﺣ ﻦﻜﻤﻳ ،ﺎﻬﻣﺎﻌﻃﺇﻭ ﺎﻬﻀﻳﻭﺮﺗ ﺪﻨﻋ<link=\"MILK\">ﻦﻛﺍﺮﺒﻟﺍ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.MOO.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MOO\">Gassy Moo</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MOO\">ﻱﺯﺎﻐﻟﺍ ﻮﻣ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.MOSQUITO.BABY.DESC"
msgid ""
"A wiggly little Gnit Larva.\n"
"\n"
"In time, it will mature into an irritating <link=\"MOSQUITO\">Gnit</link>."
msgstr ""
".ﺖﻨﺠﻟﺍ ﻦﻣ ﺔﻳﻮﻠﺘﻣ ﺓﺮﻴﻐﺻ ﺔﻗﺮﻳ\n"
"\n"
" ﺢﺒﺼﺘﻟ ﺞﻀﻨﺘﺳ ،ﺖﻗﻮﻟﺍ ﺭﻭﺮﻣ ﻊﻣ<link=\"MOSQUITO\">ﺖﻨﺟ</link>.ﺞﻋﺰﻣ "

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.MOSQUITO.BABY.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MOSQUITO\">Gnit Larva</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MOSQUITO\">ﺽﻮﻌﺒﻟﺍ ﺔﻗﺮﻳ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.MOSQUITO.DESC"
msgid ""
"Gnits are hostile airborne critters primarily bred as food for the carnivorous <link=\"FLYTRAPPLANT\">Lura Plants</link> to produce <link=\"AMBER\">Amber</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Their offspring must be exposed to <link=\"ELEMENTSLIQUID\">Liquid</link> in order to survive."
msgstr ""
" ﺕﺎﺗﺎﺒﻨﻟ ﻡﺎﻌﻄﻛ ﺎﺳﺎﺳﺃ ﻰﺑﺮﺗ ﺓﺮﺋﺎﻃ ﺔﻳﺩﺎﻌﻣ ﺕﺎﻗﻮﻠﺨﻣ ﻲﻫ ﺕﺎﺘﻴﻨﺠﻟﺍ<link=\"FLYTRAPPLANT\">ﺍﺭﻮﻟ</link> ﺝﺎﺘﻧﻹ ﻡﻮﺤﻠﻟﺍ ﺔﻠﻛﺁ <link=\"AMBER\">ﺮﺒﻨﻌﻟﺍ</link>.\n"
"\n"
" ـﻟ ﻢﻬﺘﻳﺭﺫ ﺾﻳﺮﻌﺗ ﺐﺠﻳ<link=\"ELEMENTSLIQUID\">ﻞﺋﺎﺴﻟﺍ</link>.ﺓﺎﻴﺤﻟﺍ ﺪﻴﻗ ﻰﻠﻋ ﺀﺎﻘﺒﻟﺍ ﻞﺟﺃ ﻦﻣ "

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.MOSQUITO.EGG_NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MOSQUITO\">Gnit Egg</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MOSQUITO\">ﺽﻮﻌﺒﻟﺍ ﺔﻀﻴﺑ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.MOSQUITO.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MOSQUITO\">Gnit</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MOSQUITO\">ﺖﻴﻨﻏ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.MUSHROOMPLANT.DESC"
msgid ""
"Dusk Caps produce <link=\"MUSHROOM\">Mushrooms</link>, fungal growths that "
"can be harvested for <link=\"FOOD\">Food</link>."
msgstr ""
" ﻖﺴﻐﻟﺍ ﺕﺎﻌﺒﻗ ﺞﺘﻨﺗ<link=\"MUSHROOM\">ﺮﻄﻔﻟﺍ</link> ﻰﻠﻋ ﻝﻮﺼﺤﻠﻟ ﻩﺩﺎﺼﺣ ﻦﻜﻤﻳ ﻲﻋﺎﻘﻓ"
" ﻮﻤﻧ ﻮﻫﻭ ،<link=\"FOOD\">ﻡﺎﻌﻄﻟﺍ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.MUSHROOMPLANT.DOMESTICATEDDESC"
msgid "This plant produces edible <link=\"MUSHROOM\">Mushrooms</link>."
msgstr " ﺞﺘﻨﻳ ﺕﺎﺒﻨﻟﺍ ﺍﺬﻫ<link=\"MUSHROOM\">ﺮﻄﻔﻟﺍ</link>.ﻞﻛﻸﻟ ﺢﻟﺎﺼﻟﺍ "

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.MUSHROOMPLANT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MUSHROOMPLANT\">Dusk Cap</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MUSHROOMPLANT\">ﺏﻭﺮﻐﻟﺍ ﺔﻌﺒﻗ</link>"

