msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.PINKROCK.CODEX"
msgid ""
"Lumen quartz is a naturally occurring object found in the "
"<link=\"BIOMECARROTQUARRY\">Cool Pool</link> biome."
msgstr ""
" ﻲﺌﻴﺒﻟﺍ ﻡﺎﻈﻨﻟﺍ ﻲﻓ ﺩﻮﺟﻮﻣ ﻲﻌﻴﺒﻃ ﻢﺴﺟ ﻮﻫ ﻦﻴﻣﻮﻟ "
"ﺰﺗﺭﺍﻮﻛ<link=\"BIOMECARROTQUARRY\">ﺓﺩﺭﺎﺑ ﺔﻛﺮﺑ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.PINKROCK.DESC"
msgid ""
"Lumen quartz emits a soft glowing <link=\"LIGHT\">Light</link> that makes everything look and feel a little rosier.\n"
"\n"
"It's even brighter and more beautiful once it's been carved."
msgstr ""
" ﺞﻫﻮﺘﻣﻭ ﻒﻴﻄﻟ ﺀﻮﺿ ﻪﻨﻣ ﺚﻌﺒﻨﻳ ﻦﻴﻣﻮﻟ ﺰﺗﺭﺍﻮﻛ<link=\"LIGHT\">ﺀﻲﻀﻳ</link>.ﻝﺅﺎﻔﺘﻟﺍ ﻦﻣ ﺪﻳﺰﻤﺑ ﺮﻌﺸﻳﻭ ﻭﺪﺒﻳ ﺀﻲﺷ ﻞﻛ ﻞﻌﺠﻳ \n"
"\n"
".ﻪﺘﺤﻧ ﺩﺮﺠﻤﺑ ﻻﺎﻤﺟﻭ ﺎﻗﺍﺮﺷﺇ ﺮﺜﻛﺃ ﺢﺒﺼﻳ"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.PINKROCK.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"PINKROCK\">Lumen Quartz</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"PINKROCK\">ﺰﺗﺭﺍﻮﻛ ﻦﻴﻣﻮﻟ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.PINKROCKCARVED.DESC"
msgid ""
"A Duplicant has carved this Lumen quartz in a way that really maximizes its "
"<link=\"DECOR\">Decor</link> value and <link=\"LIGHT\">brightness</link>."
msgstr ""
" ﻲﻓ ﻪﺘﻤﻴﻗ ﺎﻘﺣ ﻢﻈﻌﺗ ﺔﻘﻳﺮﻄﺑ ﻦﻣﻮﻠﻟﺍ ﺰﺗﺭﺍﻮﻜﻟﺍ ﺍﺬﻫ ﺦﺴﻨﻟﺍ ﺪﺣﺃ ﺶﻘﻧ "
"ﺪﻘﻟ<link=\"DECOR\">ﺔﻨﻳﺰﻟﺍ</link>ﻭ <link=\"LIGHT\">ﻉﻮﻄﺴﻟﺍ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.PINKROCKCARVED.NAME"
