msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ENRICHEDURANIUM.DESC"
msgid ""
"(U) Enriched Uranium is a refined substance primarily used to <link=\"POWER\">Power</link> potent research reactors.\n"
"\n"
"It becomes highly <link=\"RADIATION\">Radioactive</link> when consumed."
msgstr ""
"(U) ﻞﻴﻐﺸﺘﻟ ﺎﺳﺎﺳﺃ ﻡﺪﺨﺘﺴﺗ ﺓﺭﺮﻜﻣ ﺓﺩﺎﻣ ﻮﻫ ﺐﺼﺨﻤﻟﺍ ﻡﻮﻴﻧﺍﺭﻮﻴﻟﺍ <link=\"POWER\">ﺔﻴﺜﺤﺒﻟﺍ ﺕﻼﻋﺎﻔﻤﻟﺍ</link>.ﺔﻳﻮﻘﻟﺍ \n"
"\n"
" ﺪﻳﺪﺷ ﺢﺒﺼﻳ<link=\"RADIATION\">ﻉﺎﻌﺷﻹﺍ</link>.ﻪﻛﻼﻬﺘﺳﺍ ﺪﻨﻋ "

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ENRICHEDURANIUM.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"ENRICHEDURANIUM\">Enriched Uranium</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"ENRICHEDURANIUM\">ﺐﺼﺨﻤﻟﺍ ﻡﻮﻴﻧﺍﺭﻮﻴﻟﺍ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ETHANOL.DESC"
msgid ""
"(C<sub>2</sub>H<sub>6</sub>O) Ethanol is an advanced chemical compound in a <link=\"ELEMENTSLIQUID\">Liquid</link> state.\n"
"\n"
"It can be used as a highly effective fuel source when burned."
msgstr ""
"(C<sub>2</sub>H<sub>6</sub>O) ﺔﻟﺎﺣ ﻲﻓ ﻡﺪﻘﺘﻣ ﻲﺋﺎﻴﻤﻴﻛ ﺐﻛﺮﻣ ﻮﻫ ﻝﻮﻧﺎﺜﻳﻹﺍ <link=\"ELEMENTSLIQUID\">ﺔﻠﺋﺎﺳ</link>.\n"
"\n"
".ﻪﻗﺮﺣ ﺪﻨﻋ ﺔﻳﺎﻐﻠﻟ ﻝﺎﻌﻓ ﺩﻮﻗﻭ ﺭﺪﺼﻤﻛ ﻪﻣﺍﺪﺨﺘﺳﺍ ﻦﻜﻤﻳ"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ETHANOL.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"ETHANOL\">Ethanol</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"ETHANOL\">ﻝﻮﻧﺎﺜﻳﻹﺍ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ETHANOLGAS.DESC"
msgid ""
"(C<sub>2</sub>H<sub>6</sub>O) Ethanol Gas is an advanced chemical compound "
"heated into a <link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">Gaseous</link> state."
msgstr ""
"(C<sub>2</sub>H<sub>6</sub>O) ﺔﻟﺎﺣ ﻰﻟﺇ ﻪﻨﻴﺨﺴﺗ ﻢﺘﻳ ﻡﺪﻘﺘﻣ ﻲﺋﺎﻴﻤﻴﻛ ﺐﻛﺮﻣ ﻮﻫ "
"ﻝﻮﻧﺎﺜﻳﻹﺍ ﺯﺎﻏ <link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">ﺔﻳﺯﺎﻏ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ETHANOLGAS.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"ETHANOLGAS\">Ethanol Gas</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"ETHANOLGAS\">ﻝﻮﻧﺎﺜﻳﻹﺍ ﺯﺎﻏ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FABRICATEDWOOD.DESC"
msgid ""
"Plywood is a good source of <link=\"HEAT\">Heat</link> and <link=\"POWER\">Power</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Its insulation properties make it a useful <b>Construction Material</b>."
msgstr ""
"ﻞﻟ ﺪﻴﺟ ﺭﺪﺼﻣ ﻮﻫ ﻲﻘﺋﺎﻗﺮﻟﺍ ﺐﺸﺨﻟﺍ<النار>ﺓﺭﺍﺮﺤﻟﺍ</النار>ﻭ <القوة>ﺔﻗﺎﻄﻟﺍ</القوة>.\n"
"\n"
" ﺓﺩﺎﻣ ﻪﻠﻌﺠﺗ ﺔﻟﺯﺎﻌﻟﺍ ﻪﺼﺋﺎﺼﺧ<b>ﺔﻴﺋﺎﺸﻧﺇ</b>.ﺓﺪﻴﻔﻣ "

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FABRICATEDWOOD.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"FABRICATEDWOOD\">Plywood</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"FABRICATEDWOOD\">ﻲﻘﺋﺎﻗﺮﻟﺍ ﺐﺸﺨﻟﺍ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FALLOUT.DESC"
msgid ""
"Nuclear Fallout is a highly toxic gas full of "
"<link=\"RADIATION\">Radioactive Contaminants</link>. Condenses into "
"<link=\"NUCLEARWASTE\">Liquid Nuclear Waste</link>."
msgstr ""
"ـﺑ ﺀﻲﻠﻣ ﺍﺪﺟ ﻡﺎﺳ ﺯﺎﻏ ﻮﻫ ﻱﻭﻮﻨﻟﺍ ﻁﻮﻘﺴﻟﺍ<اسم الرابط=\"RADIATION\">ﺔﻴﻋﺎﻌﺷﻹﺍ "
"ﺕﺎﺛﻮﻠﻤﻟﺍ</اسم الرابط> ﺢﺒﺼﻴﻟ ﻒﺜﻜﺘﻳﻭ .<اسم الرابط=\"NUCLEARWASTE\">ﺔﻠﺋﺎﺳ ﺔﻳﻭﻮﻧ"
" ﺕﺎﻳﺎﻔﻧ</اسم الرابط>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FALLOUT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"FALLOUT\">Nuclear Fallout</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"FALLOUT\">ﺔﻳﻭﻮﻨﻟﺍ ﺞﺋﺎﺘﻨﻟﺍ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FERTILIZER.DESC"
msgid ""
"Fertilizer is a processed mixture of biological nutrients.\n"
"\n"
"It aids in the growth of certain <link=\"PLANTS\">Plants</link>."
msgstr ""
".ﺔﻴﺟﻮﻟﻮﻴﺒﻟﺍ ﺔﻴﺋﺍﺬﻐﻟﺍ ﺩﺍﻮﻤﻟﺍ ﻦﻣ ﺞﻟﺎﻌﻣ ﻂﻴﻠﺧ ﻲﻫ ﺓﺪﻤﺳﻷﺍ\n"
"\n"
" ﺾﻌﺑ ﻮﻤﻧ ﻲﻓ ﺪﻋﺎﺴﺗ ﺎﻬﻧﺇ<link=\"PLANTS\">ﺕﺎﺗﺎﺒﻨﻟﺍ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FERTILIZER.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"FERTILIZER\">Fertilizer</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"FERTILIZER\">ﺩﺎﻤﺳ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FOOLSGOLD.DESC"
msgid ""
"(FeS<sub>2</sub>) Pyrite is a conductive <link=\"RAWMETAL\">Metal</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Also known as \"Fool's Gold\", is suitable for building <link=\"POWER\">Power</link> systems."
msgstr ""
"(FeS<sub>2</sub> ﻮﻫ ﺖﻳﺮﻴﺒﻟﺍ (<link=\"RAWMETAL\">ﻥﺪﻌﻣ</link>.ﻞﺻﻮﻣ \n"
"\n"
" ﺀﺎﻨﺒﻟ ﺐﺳﺎﻨﻣ ﻮﻫﻭ ،\"ﻰﻘﻤﺤﻟﺍ ﺐﻫﺫ\" ﻢﺳﺎﺑ ﺎﻀﻳﺃ ﻑﺮﻌﻳﻭ<link=\"POWER\">ﺔﻗﺎﻄﻟﺍ ﺔﻤﻈﻧﺃ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FOOLSGOLD.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"FOOLSGOLD\">Pyrite</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"FOOLSGOLD\">ﺖﻳﺮﻴﺒﻟﺍ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FOSSIL.DESC"
msgid ""
"Fossil is organic matter, highly compressed and hardened into a mineral state.\n"
"\n"
"It is useful as a <b>Construction Material</b>."
msgstr ""
".ﺔﻴﻧﺪﻌﻣ ﺔﻟﺎﺣ ﻰﻟﺇ ﺓﺮﺠﺤﺘﻣﻭ ﺓﺪﺸﺑ ﺔﻃﻮﻐﻀﻣ ،ﺔﻳﻮﻀﻋ ﺓﺩﺎﻣ ﻲﻫ ﺔﻳﺮﻔﺤﻟﺍ\n"
"\n"
" ﺓﺩﺎﻤﻛ ﺓﺪﻴﻔﻣ ﻲﻫﻭ<b>ﺕﺍﺀﺎﺸﻧﻺﻟ</b>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FOSSIL.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"FOSSIL\">Fossil</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"FOSSIL\">ﺓﺭﻮﻔﺣﺃ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FROZENPHYTOOIL.DESC"
msgid ""
"Frozen Phyto Oil is thick, slippery <link=\"SLIME\">Slime</link> extract, "
"frozen into a <link=\"ELEMENTSSOLID\">Solid</link> state."
msgstr ""
" ﻦﻣ ﻖﻟﺯﻭ ﻚﻴﻤﺳ ﺺﻠﺨﺘﺴﻣ ﻮﻫ ﺪﻤﺠﻤﻟﺍ ﻮﺘﻴﻔﻟﺍ ﺖﻳﺯ<link=\"SLIME\">ﻞﺣﻮﻟﺍ</link> ﺔﻟﺎﺣ "
"ﻰﻟﺇ ﻩﺪﻴﻤﺠﺗ ﻢﺗ ،<link=\"ELEMENTSSOLID\">ﺔﺒﻠﺻ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FROZENPHYTOOIL.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"FROZENPHYTOOIL\">Frozen Phyto Oil</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"FROZENPHYTOOIL\">ﺪﻤﺠﻤﻟﺍ ﺕﺎﺗﺎﺒﻨﻟﺍ ﺖﻳﺯ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FULLERENE.DESC"
msgid ""
"(C<sub>60</sub>) Fullerene is a form of <link=\"CARBON\">Coal</link> "
"consisting of spherical molecules."
msgstr ""
"(C<sub>60</sub> ﻦﻣ ﻞﻜﺷ ﻮﻫ ﻦﻳﺮﻴﻟﻮﻔﻟﺍ (<link=\"CARBON\">ﻢﺤﻔﻟﺍ</link>.ﺔﻳﻭﺮﻛ "
"ﺕﯫﻳﺰﺟ ﻦﻣ ﻥﻮﻜﺘﻳ "

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FULLERENE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"FULLERENE\">Fullerene</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"FULLERENE\">ﻦﻳﺮﻴﻟﻮﻓ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GLASS.DESC"
msgid ""
"Glass is a brittle, transparent substance formed from "
"<link=\"SAND\">Sand</link> fired at high temperatures."
msgstr ""
" ﻦﻣ ﻥﻮﻜﺘﺗ ﺔﻓﺎﻔﺷﻭ ﺔﺸﻫ ﺓﺩﺎﻣ ﺝﺎﺟﺰﻟﺍ<link=\"SAND\">ﻞﻣﺮﻟﺍ</link>.ﺔﻴﻟﺎﻋ ﺓﺭﺍﺮﺣ "
"ﺕﺎﺟﺭﺩ ﺪﻨﻋ ﻪﻗﺮﺣ ﻢﺘﻳ "

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GLASS.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GLASS\">Glass</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GLASS\">ﺝﺎﺟﺯ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GOLD.DESC"
msgid ""
"(Au) Gold is a conductive precious <link=\"RAWMETAL\">Metal</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It is suitable for building <link=\"POWER\">Power</link> systems."
msgstr ""
"(Au) ﻮﻫ ﺐﻫﺬﻟﺍ <link=\"RAWMETAL\">ﻥﺪﻌﻣ</link>.ﻞﺻﻮﻣﻭ ﻦﻴﻤﺛ \n"
"\n"
" ﺔﻤﻈﻧﺃ ﺀﺎﻨﺒﻟ ﺐﺳﺎﻨﻣ ﻪﻧﺇ<link=\"POWER\">ﺔﻗﺎﻄﻟﺍ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GOLD.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GOLD\">Gold</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GOLD\">ﺐﻫﺫ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GOLDAMALGAM.DESC"
msgid ""
"Gold Amalgam is a conductive amalgam of gold and mercury.\n"
"\n"
"It is suitable for building <link=\"POWER\">Power</link> systems."
msgstr ""
".ﻖﺒﺋﺰﻟﺍﻭ ﺐﻫﺬﻟﺍ ﻦﻣ ﻞﺻﻮﻣ ﻢﻐﻠﻣ ﻮﻫ ﻲﺒﻫﺬﻟﺍ ﻢﻐﻠﻤﻟﺍ\n"
"\n"
" ﺔﻤﻈﻧﺃ ﺀﺎﻨﺒﻟ ﺐﺳﺎﻨﻣ ﻮﻫﻭ<link=\"POWER\">ﺔﻗﺎﻄﻟﺍ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GOLDAMALGAM.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GOLDAMALGAM\">Gold Amalgam</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GOLDAMALGAM\">ﻲﺒﻫﺬﻟﺍ ﻢﻐﻠﻤﻟﺍ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GOLDGAS.DESC"
msgid ""
"(Au) Gold Gas is a conductive precious <link=\"RAWMETAL\">Metal</link>, "
"heated into a <link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">Gaseous</link> state."
msgstr ".ﺔﻳﺯﺎﻏ ﺔﻟﺎﺣ ﻰﻟﺇ ﻦﺨﺴﻳ ،ﻞﺻﻮﻣ ﻦﻴﻤﺛ ﻥﺪﻌﻣ ﻮﻫ ﺐﻫﺬﻟﺍ ﺯﺎﻏ (ﺐﻫﺬﻟﺍ)"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GOLDGAS.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GOLDGAS\">Gold Gas</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GOLDGAS\">ﺯﺎﻏ ﺐﻫﺬﻟﺍ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GRANITE.DESC"
msgid ""
"Granite is a dense composite of <link=\"IGNEOUSROCK\">Igneous Rock</link>.\n"
"\n"
