"Can be separated into its base elements using a <link=\"SLUDGEPRESS\">Sludge Press</link>."
msgstr ""
" ﻦﻣ ﻂﻴﻠﺧ<link=\"DIRT\">ﺥﺎﺳﻭﻷﺍ</link> ﻭ <link=\"WATER\">ﺀﺎﻤﻟﺍ</link>.\n"
"\n"
" ﻡﺍﺪﺨﺘﺳﺎﺑ ﺔﻴﺳﺎﺳﻷﺍ ﻩﺮﺻﺎﻨﻋ ﻰﻟﺇ ﻪﻠﺼﻓ ﻦﻜﻤﻳ<link=\"SLUDGEPRESS\">ﺓﺄﻤﺤﻟﺍ ﺲﺒﻜﻣ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.MUD.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MUD\">Mud</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MUD\">ﻦﻴﻃ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.NAPHTHA.DESC"
msgid ""
"Naphtha a distilled hydrocarbon mixture produced from the burning of "
"<link=\"POLYPROPYLENE\">Plastic</link>."
msgstr ""
" ﻕﺮﺣ ﻦﻣ ﺞﺘﻨﻳ ﺮﻄﻘﻣ ﻲﻧﻮﺑﺮﻛﻭﺭﺪﻴﻫ ﻂﻴﻠﺧ ﻮﻫ "
"ﺎﺜﻓﺎﻧ<link=\"POLYPROPYLENE\">ﻚﻴﺘﺳﻼﺒﻟﺍ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.NAPHTHA.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"NAPHTHA\">Liquid Naphtha</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"NAPHTHA\">ﺔﻠﺋﺎﺴﻟﺍ ﺎﺜﻓﺎﻨﻟﺍ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.NATURALRESIN.DESC"
msgid ""
"Resin is a viscous organic <link=\"ELEMENTSLIQUID\">Liquid</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It can be treated to become <link=\"POLYPROPYLENE\">Plastic</link> in the <link=\"POLYMERIZER\">Polymer Press</link>."
msgstr ""
" ﺝﺰﻟ ﻱﻮﻀﻋ ﻞﺋﺎﺳ ﻮﻫ ﺞﻨﺗﺍﺮﻟﺍ<link=\"ELEMENTSLIQUID\">ﻞﺋﺎﺳ</link>.\n"
"\n"
" ﺢﺒﺼﻴﻟ ﻪﺘﺠﻟﺎﻌﻣ ﻦﻜﻤﻳ<link=\"POLYPROPYLENE\">ﻚﻴﺘﺳﻼﺑ</link> ﻲﻓ <link=\"POLYMERIZER\">ﺓﺮﻤﻠﺒﻟﺍ ﺲﺒﻜﻣ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.NATURALRESIN.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"NATURALRESIN\">Resin</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"NATURALRESIN\">ﺞﻨﺗﺍﺭ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.NATURALSOLIDRESIN.DESC"
msgid ""
"Resin that has been cooled to a <link=\"ELEMENTSSOLID\">Solid</link> state.\n"
"\n"
"It can be treated to become <link=\"POLYPROPYLENE\">Plastic</link> in the <link=\"POLYMERIZER\">Polymer Press</link>."
msgstr ""
" ﺔﻟﺎﺣ ﻰﻟﺇ ﻩﺪﻳﺮﺒﺗ ﻢﺗ ﻱﺬﻟﺍ ﺞﻨﻴﺗﺍﺮﻟﺍ<link=\"ELEMENTSSOLID\">ﺔﺒﻠﺻ</link>.\n"
"\n"
" ﺢﺒﺼﻴﻟ ﻪﺘﺠﻟﺎﻌﻣ ﻦﻜﻤﻳ<link=\"POLYPROPYLENE\">ﻚﻴﺘﺳﻼﺑ</link> ﻲﻓ <link=\"POLYMERIZER\">ﺮﻤﻴﻟﻮﺒﻟﺍ ﺲﺒﻜﻣ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.NATURALSOLIDRESIN.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"NATURALSOLIDRESIN\">Solid Resin</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"NATURALSOLIDRESIN\">ﺐﻠﺻ ﺞﻨﺗﺍﺭ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.NICKEL.DESC"
msgid ""
"(Ni) Nickel is a conductive <link=\"METAL\">Metal</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It is suitable for building <link=\"POWER\">Power</link> systems."
msgstr ""
" ﻮﻫ ﻞﻜﻴﻨﻟﺍ (ﻲﻧ)<link=\"METAL\">ﻥﺪﻌﻣ</link> .ﻞﺻﻮﻣ \n"
"\n"
" ﺀﺎﻨﺒﻟ ﺐﺳﺎﻨﻣ ﻪﻧﺇ<link=\"POWER\">ﺔﻗﺎﻄﻟﺍ ﺔﻤﻈﻧﺃ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.NICKEL.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"NICKEL\">Nickel</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"NICKEL\">ﻞﻜﻴﻧ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.NICKELGAS.DESC"
msgid ""
"(Ni) Nickel Gas is a conductive <link=\"METAL\">Metal</link> heated into a "
"<link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">Gas</link> state."
msgstr ""
" ﻮﻫ ﻞﻜﻴﻨﻟﺍ ﺯﺎﻏ (ﻲﻧ)<link=\"METAL\">ﻥﺪﻌﻣ</link> ﺔﻟﺎﺣ ﻰﻟﺇ ﻪﻨﻴﺨﺴﺗ ﻢﺘﻳ ﻞﺻﻮﻣ "
"<link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">ﺯﺎﻏ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.NICKELGAS.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"NICKELGAS\">Nickel Gas</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"NICKELGAS\">ﻞﻜﻴﻨﻟﺍ ﺯﺎﻏ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.NICKELORE.DESC"
msgid ""
"(Ni) Nickel Ore is a conductive <link=\"RAWMETAL\">Metal</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It can be refined into <link=\"NICKEL\">Nickel</link> and is suitable for building <link=\"POWER\">Power</link> systems."
msgstr ""
" ﻮﻫ ﻞﻜﻴﻨﻟﺍ ﻡﺎﺧ (ﻲﻧ)<link=\"RAWMETAL\">ﻥﺪﻌﻣ</link>.ﻞﺻﻮﻣ \n"
"\n"
" ﻰﻟﺇ ﻩﺮﻳﺮﻜﺗ ﻦﻜﻤﻳ<link=\"NICKEL\">ﻞﻜﻴﻧ</link> ﺔﻤﻈﻧﺃ ﺀﺎﻨﺒﻟ ﺐﺳﺎﻨﻣﻭ <link=\"POWER\">ﺔﻗﺎﻄﻟﺍ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.NICKELORE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"NICKELORE\">Nickel Ore</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"NICKELORE\">ﻞﻜﻴﻨﻟﺍ ﻡﺎﺧ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.NIOBIUM.DESC"
msgid ""
"(Nb) Niobium is a rare metal with many practical applications in metallurgy "
"and superconductor <link=\"RESEARCH\">Research</link>."
msgstr ""
"(Nb) ﺔﻘﺋﺎﻔﻟﺍ ﺕﻼﺻﻮﻤﻟﺍﻭ ﻥﺩﺎﻌﻤﻟﺍ ﻢﻠﻋ ﻲﻓ ﺔﻴﻠﻤﻌﻟﺍ ﺕﺎﻘﻴﺒﻄﺘﻟﺍ ﻦﻣ ﺪﻳﺪﻌﻟﺍ ﻪﻟ ﺭﺩﺎﻧ "
"ﻥﺪﻌﻣ ﻡﻮﻴﺒﻴﻨﻟﺍ <link=\"RESEARCH\">ﺚﺤﺒﻟﺍ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.NIOBIUM.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"NIOBIUM\">Niobium</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"NIOBIUM\">ﺎﻴﺑﻮﻴﻧ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.NIOBIUMGAS.DESC"
msgid ""
"(Nb) Niobium Gas is a rare metal.\n"
"\n"
"This selection is in a <link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">Gaseous</link> state."
msgstr ""
"(Nb) ﺭﺩﺎﻧ ﻥﺪﻌﻣ ﻮﻫ ﻡﻭﺎﻴﺑﻮﻴﻨﻟﺍ ﺯﺎﻏ.\n"
"\n"
" ﺔﻟﺎﺣ ﻲﻓ ﺭﺎﻴﺘﺧﻻﺍ ﺍﺬﻫ<link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">ﺔﻳﺯﺎﻏ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.NIOBIUMGAS.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"NIOBIUMGAS\">Niobium Gas</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"NIOBIUMGAS\">ﻡﻮﻴﺒﻴﻨﻟﺍ ﺯﺎﻏ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.NUCLEARWASTE.DESC"
msgid ""
"Highly toxic liquid full of <link=\"RADIATION\">Radioactive "
"Contaminants</link> which emit <link=\"RADIATION\">Radiation</link> that can"
" be absorbed by <link=\"HIGHENERGYPARTICLESPAWNER\">Radbolt "
"Generators</link>."
msgstr ""
"ـﺑ ﺀﻲﻠﻣ ﺔﻴﻤﺴﻟﺍ ﺪﻳﺪﺷ ﻞﺋﺎﺳ<رابط=\"RADIATION\">ﺔﻌﺸﻤﻟﺍ ﺔﺛﻮﻠﻤﻟﺍ ﺩﺍﻮﻤﻟﺍ</رابط> "
"ﺭﺪﺼﺗ ﻲﺘﻟﺍ <رابط=\"RADIATION\">ﻉﺎﻌﺷﻹﺍ</رابط> ﺔﻄﺳﺍﻮﺑ ﻪﺻﺎﺼﺘﻣﺍ ﻦﻜﻤﻳ ﻱﺬﻟﺍ "
"<رابط=\"HIGHENERGYPARTICLESPAWNER\">ﺖﻟﻮﺑﺩﺍﺭ ﺕﺍﺪﻟﻮﻣ</رابط>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.NUCLEARWASTE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"NUCLEARWASTE\">Liquid Nuclear Waste</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"NUCLEARWASTE\">ﺔﻠﺋﺎﺴﻟﺍ ﺔﻳﻭﻮﻨﻟﺍ ﺕﺎﻳﺎﻔﻨﻟﺍ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.OBSIDIAN.DESC"
msgid "Obsidian is a brittle composite of volcanic <link=\"GLASS\">Glass</link>."
msgstr " ﻲﻧﺎﻛﺮﺒﻟﺍ ﺝﺎﺟﺰﻟﺍ ﻦﻣ ﺶﻫ ﺐﻛﺮﻣ ﻮﻫ ﺪﻴﻤﺼﻘﻟﺍ<link=\"GLASS\">ﺝﺎﺟﺯ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.OBSIDIAN.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"OBSIDIAN\">Obsidian</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"OBSIDIAN\">ﻥﺎﻳﺪﻴﺴﺑﻭﺃ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.OXYROCK.DESC"
msgid ""
"(Ir<sub>3</sub>O<sub>2</sub>) Oxylite is a chemical compound that slowly emits breathable <link=\"OXYGEN\">Oxygen</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Excavating <link=\"OXYROCK\">Oxylite</link> increases its emission rate, but depletes the ore more rapidly."
msgstr ""
"(Ir<sub>3</sub>O<sub>2</sub> ﺀﻂﺒﺑ ﻪﻨﻣ ﺚﻌﺒﻨﻳ ﻲﺋﺎﻴﻤﻴﻛ ﺐﻛﺮﻣ ﻮﻫ ﺖﻴﻠﻴﺴﻛﺃ (<link=\"OXYGEN\">ﻦﻴﺠﺴﻛﻷﺍ</link>.ﺲﻔﻨﺘﻠﻟ ﻞﺑﺎﻘﻟﺍ \n"
"\n"
" ﺝﺍﺮﺨﺘﺳﺍ ﻱﺩﺆﻳ<link=\"OXYROCK\">ﺖﻴﻠﻴﺴﻛﻷﺍ</link>.ﻉﺮﺳﺃ ﻞﻜﺸﺑ ﻡﺎﺨﻟﺍ ﻑﺰﻨﺘﺴﻳ ﻪﻨﻜﻟ ،ﻪﺛﺎﻌﺒﻧﺍ ﻝﺪﻌﻣ ﺓﺩﺎﻳﺯ ﻰﻟﺇ "

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.OXYROCK.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"OXYROCK\">Oxylite</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"OXYROCK\">ﺖﻳﻼﻳﺎﺴﻛﻭﺃ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.PEAT.DESC"
msgid ""
"Peat is a densely packed material made up of partially decomposed organic matter.\n"
"\n"
"It is a combustible fuel, useful in <link=\"POWER\">Power</link> production."
msgstr ""
".ﺎﻴﺋﺰﺟ ﺔﻠﻠﺤﺘﻣ ﺔﻳﻮﻀﻋ ﺩﺍﻮﻣ ﻦﻣ ﻥﻮﻜﺘﺗ ﺔﻓﺎﺜﻜﺑ ﺔﻃﻮﻐﻀﻣ ﺓﺩﺎﻣ ﻮﻫ ﻲﺋﺎﻤﻟﺍ ﺰﺒﺨﻟﺍ\n"
"\n"
" ﺝﺎﺘﻧﺇ ﻲﻓ ﺪﻴﻔﻣ ،ﻝﺎﻌﺘﺷﻼﻟ ﻞﺑﺎﻗ ﺩﻮﻗﻭ ﻪﻧﺇ<link=\"POWER\">ﺔﻗﺎﻄﻟﺍ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.PEAT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"PEAT\">Peat</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"PEAT\">ﺚﺒﺨﻟﺍ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.PETROLEUM.DESC"
msgid ""
"Petroleum is a <link=\"POWER\">Power</link> source refined from <link=\"CRUDEOIL\">Crude Oil</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It is also an essential ingredient in the production of <link=\"POLYPROPYLENE\">Plastic</link>."
msgstr ""
" ﺭﺪﺼﻣ ﻮﻫ ﻝﻭﺮﺘﺒﻟﺍ<link=\"POWER\">ﺔﻗﺎﻄﻟﺍ</link> ﻦﻣ ﻩﺮﻳﺮﻜﺗ ﻢﺘﻳ <link=\"CRUDEOIL\">ﻡﺎﺨﻟﺍ ﻂﻔﻨﻟﺍ</link>.\n"
"\n"
" ﺝﺎﺘﻧﺇ ﻲﻓ ﻲﺳﺎﺳﺃ ﻥﻮﻜﻣ ﻪﻧﺃ ﺎﻤﻛ<link=\"POLYPROPYLENE\">ﻚﻴﺘﺳﻼﺒﻟﺍ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.PETROLEUM.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"PETROLEUM\">Petroleum</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"PETROLEUM\">ﻝﻭﺮﺘﺒﻟﺍ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.PETROLEUM.NAME_TWO"
msgid "<link=\"PETROLEUM\">Petroleum</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"PETROLEUM\">ﻝﻭﺮﺘﺒﻟﺍ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.PHOSPHATENODULES.DESC"
msgid ""
"(PO<sup>3-</sup><sub>4</sub>) Nodules of sedimentary rock containing high "
"concentrations of phosphate."
msgstr ""
".(PO³⁻₄) ﺕﺎﻔﺳﻮﻔﻟﺍ ﻦﻣ ﺔﻴﻟﺎﻋ ﺕﺍﺰﻴﻛﺮﺗ ﻰﻠﻋ ﻱﻮﺘﺤﺗ ﺔﻴﺑﻮﺳﺮﻟﺍ ﺭﻮﺨﺼﻟﺍ ﻦﻣ ﺕﺍﺪﻴﻘﻋ"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.PHOSPHATENODULES.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"PHOSPHATENODULES\">Phosphate Nodules</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"PHOSPHATENODULES\">ﺕﺎﻔﺳﻮﻔﻟﺍ ﺕﺍﺪﻴﻘﻋ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.PHOSPHORITE.DESC"
msgid ""
"Phosphorite is a composite of sedimentary rock, saturated with phosphate."
msgstr ".ﻁﺎﻔﺳﻮﻔﻟﺎﺑ ﻊﺒﺸﻣ ،ﺔﻴﺑﻮﺳﺮﻟﺍ ﺭﻮﺨﺼﻟﺍ ﻦﻣ ﺐﻛﺮﻣ ﻮﻫ ﺖﻴﺗﺎﻔﺳﻮﻔﻟﺍ"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.PHOSPHORITE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"PHOSPHORITE\">Phosphorite</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"PHOSPHORITE\">ﺖﻳﺭﻮﻔﺳﻮﻔﻟﺍ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.PHOSPHORUS.DESC"
msgid ""
"(P) Refined Phosphorus is a chemical element in its "
"<link=\"ELEMENTSSOLID\">Solid</link> state."
msgstr ""
"(P) ﻪﺘﻟﺎﺣ ﻲﻓ ﻲﺋﺎﻴﻤﻴﻛ ﺮﺼﻨﻋ ﻮﻫ ﺭﺮﻜﻤﻟﺍ ﺭﻮﻔﺳﻮﻔﻟﺍ "
"<link=\"ELEMENTSSOLID\">ﺔﺒﻠﺼﻟﺍ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.PHOSPHORUS.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"PHOSPHORUS\">Refined Phosphorus</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"PHOSPHORUS\">ﺭﺮﻜﻤﻟﺍ ﺭﻮﻔﺳﻮﻔﻟﺍ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.PHOSPHORUSGAS.DESC"
msgid ""
"(P) Phosphorus Gas is the <link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">Gaseous</link> state of "
"<link=\"PHOSPHORUS\">Refined Phosphorus</link>."
msgstr ""
"(P) ﺔﻟﺎﺤﻟﺍ ﻮﻫ ﺭﻮﻔﺳﻮﻔﻟﺍ ﺯﺎﻏ <link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">ﺔﻳﺯﺎﻐﻟﺍ</link> ـﻟ "
"<link=\"PHOSPHORUS\">ﺭﺮﻜﻤﻟﺍ ﺭﻮﻔﺳﻮﻔﻟﺍ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.PHOSPHORUSGAS.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"PHOSPHORUSGAS\">Phosphorus Gas</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"PHOSPHORUSGAS\">ﺭﻮﻔﺴﻔﻟﺍ ﺯﺎﻏ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.PHYTOOIL.DESC"
msgid ""
"Phyto Oil is a thick, slippery <link=\"ELEMENTSLIQUID\">Liquid</link> "
"extracted from pureed <link=\"SLIME\">Slime</link>."
msgstr ".ﻲﻘﻨﻟﺍ ﻞﺣﻮﻟﺍ ﺱﻭﺮﻬﻣ ﻦﻣ ﺝﺮﺨﺘﺴﻳ ﻒﻴﺜﻛﻭ ﺝﺰﻟ ﻞﺋﺎﺳ ﻮﻫ ﻮﺘﻴﻓ ﺖﻳﺯ"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.PHYTOOIL.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"PHYTOOIL\">Phyto Oil</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"PHYTOOIL\">ﻲﺗﺎﺒﻧ ﺖﻳﺯ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.POLYPROPYLENE.BUILD_DESC"
msgid ""
"Buildings made of this <link=\"POLYPROPYLENE\">Plastic</link> have "
"antiseptic properties"
msgstr ""
" ﺍﺬﻫ ﻦﻣ ﺔﻋﻮﻨﺼﻤﻟﺍ ﻲﻧﺎﺒﻤﻟﺍ<link=\"POLYPROPYLENE\">ﻚﻴﺘﺳﻼﺒﻟﺍ</link>ﺓﺮﻬﻄﻣ ﺺﺋﺎﺼﺧ "
"ﺎﻬﻟ "

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.POLYPROPYLENE.DESC"
msgid ""
"(C<sub>3</sub>H<sub>6</sub>)<sub>n</sub> <link=\"POLYPROPYLENE\">Plastic</link> is a thermoplastic polymer.\n"
"\n"
"It is useful for constructing a variety of advanced buildings and equipment."
msgstr ""
"(C<sub>3</sub>H<sub>6</sub>)<sub>n</sub> <link=\"POLYPROPYLENE\">ﻚﻴﺘﺳﻼﺒﻟﺍ</link>.ﺮﻬﺼﻠﻟ ﻞﺑﺎﻗ ﻱﺭﺍﺮﺣ ﺮﻤﻴﻟﻮﺑ ﻮﻫ \n"
"\n"
".ﺔﻣﺪﻘﺘﻤﻟﺍ ﺕﺍﺪﻌﻤﻟﺍﻭ ﻲﻧﺎﺒﻤﻟﺍ ﻦﻣ ﺔﻋﻮﻨﺘﻣ ﺔﻋﻮﻤﺠﻣ ﺀﺎﻨﺒﻟ ﺪﻴﻔﻣ ﻮﻫ"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.POLYPROPYLENE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"POLYPROPYLENE\">Plastic</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"POLYPROPYLENE\">ﻚﻴﺘﺳﻼﺑ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.PONDSCUM.DESC"
msgid ""
"Pondscum is a soft, naturally occurring composite of biological nutrients.\n"
"\n"
"It may be processed into <link=\"FERTILIZER\">Fertilizer</link> and aids in the growth of certain <link=\"PLANTS\">Plants</link>."
msgstr ""
".ﺔﻴﺟﻮﻟﻮﻴﺒﻟﺍ ﺕﺎﻳﺬﻐﻤﻟﺍ ﻦﻣ ﻲﻌﻴﺒﻃﻭ ﻢﻋﺎﻧ ﺐﻛﺮﻣ ﻮﻫ ﻙﺮﺒﻟﺍ ﺐﻠﺤﻃ\n"
"\n"
" ﻰﻟﺇ ﻪﺘﺠﻟﺎﻌﻣ ﻦﻜﻤﻳ<link=\"FERTILIZER\">ﺩﺎﻤﺳ</link> ﺾﻌﺑ ﻮﻤﻧ ﻲﻓ ﺪﻋﺎﺴﻳﻭ <link=\"PLANTS\">ﺕﺎﺗﺎﺒﻨﻟﺍ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.PONDSCUM.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"PONDSCUM\">Pondscum</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"PONDSCUM\">ﺔﻛﺮﺒﻟﺍ ﺓﺭﺍﺬﻗ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.PROPANE.DESC"
msgid ""
"(C<sub>3</sub>H<sub>8</sub>) Propane Gas is a natural alkane.\n"
"\n"
"This selection is in a <link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">Gaseous</link> state.\n"
"\n"
"It is useful in <link=\"POWER\">Power</link> production."
msgstr ""
"(C<sub>3</sub>H<sub>8</sub>.ﻲﻌﻴﺒﻃ ﻥﺎﻜﻟﺃ ﻮﻫ ﻥﺎﺑﻭﺮﺒﻟﺍ ﺯﺎﻏ (\n"
"\n"
" ﺔﻟﺎﺣ ﻲﻓ ﺭﺎﻴﺘﺧﻻﺍ ﺍﺬﻫ<link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">ﺔﻳﺯﺎﻏ</link>.\n"
"\n"
" ﺝﺎﺘﻧﺇ ﻲﻓ ﺪﻴﻔﻣ ﻮﻫﻭ<link=\"POWER\">ﺔﻗﺎﻄﻟﺍ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.PROPANE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"PROPANE\">Propane Gas</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"PROPANE\">ﻥﺎﺑﻭﺮﺒﻟﺍ ﺯﺎﻏ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.RADIATIONPROPERTIES"
msgid ""
"Radiation Absorption Factor: {0}\n"
"Radiation Emission/1000kg: {1}"
msgstr ""
" :ﻉﺎﻌﺷﻹﺍ ﺹﺎﺼﺘﻣﺍ ﻞﻣﺎﻋ{0}\n"
" :ﻢﺠﻛ 1000/ﻉﺎﻌﺷﻹﺍ ﺙﺎﻌﺒﻧﺍ{1}"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.RADIUM.DESC"
msgid ""
"(Ra) Radium is a <link=\"LIGHT\">Light</link> emitting radioactive substance.\n"
"\n"
"It is useful as a <link=\"POWER\">Power</link> source."
msgstr ""
"(Ra) ﺚﻌﺒﺗ ﺔﻌﺸﻣ ﺓﺩﺎﻣ ﻮﻫ ﻡﻮﻳﺩﺍﺮﻟﺍ <link=\"LIGHT\">ﺀﻮﻀﻟﺍ</link>.\n"
"\n"
" ﺭﺪﺼﻤﻛ ﺪﻴﻔﻣ ﻪﻧﺇ<link=\"POWER\">ﺔﻗﺎﻄﻟ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.RADIUM.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"RADIUM\">Radium</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"RADIUM\">ﻡﻮﻳﺩﺍﺮﻟﺍ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.REFINEDCARBON.DESC"
msgid ""
"(C) Refined carbon is solid element purified from raw "
"<link=\"CARBON\">Coal</link>."
msgstr ""
" ﻦﻣ ﻪﺘﻴﻘﻨﺗ ﻢﺘﻳ ﺐﻠﺻ ﺮﺼﻨﻋ ﻮﻫ ﺭﺮﻜﻤﻟﺍ ﻥﻮﺑﺮﻜﻟﺍ "
"(ﺝ)<link=\"CARBON\">ﻢﺤﻔﻟﺍ</link>.ﻡﺎﺨﻟﺍ "

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.REFINEDCARBON.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"REFINEDCARBON\">Refined Carbon</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"REFINEDCARBON\">ﺭﺮﻜﻤﻟﺍ ﻥﻮﺑﺮﻜﻟﺍ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.REFINEDLIPID.DESC"
msgid ""
"Biodiesel is a <link=\"ELEMENTSLIQUID\">Liquid</link> composed of highly processed fatty acids derived from purified natural oils.\n"
"\n"
"Its <link=\"COMBUSTIBLELIQUID\">combustibility</link> makes it useful for <link=\"POWER\">Power</link> production."
msgstr ""
" ﻮﻫ ﻱﻮﻴﺤﻟﺍ ﻝﺰﻳﺪﻟﺍ<link=\"ELEMENTSLIQUID\">ﻞﺋﺎﺳ</link>.ﺓﺎﻘﻨﻤﻟﺍ ﺔﻴﻌﻴﺒﻄﻟﺍ ﺕﻮﻳﺰﻟﺍ ﻦﻣ ﺔﻘﺘﺸﻣ ﺔﻳﺎﻐﻠﻟ ﺔﺠﻟﺎﻌﻣ ﺔﻴﻨﻫﺩ ﺽﺎﻤﺣﺃ ﻦﻣ ﻥﻮﻜﺘﻳ \n"
"\n"
" ﻪﻠﻌﺠﺗ<link=\"COMBUSTIBLELIQUID\">ﻪﻗﺍﺮﺘﺣﺍ ﺔﻴﻠﺑﺎﻗ</link> ﺝﺎﺘﻧﻹ ﺍﺪﻴﻔﻣ <link=\"POWER\">ﺔﻗﺎﻄﻟﺍ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.REFINEDLIPID.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"REFINEDLIPID\">Biodiesel</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"REFINEDLIPID\">ﻱﻮﻴﺣ ﺩﻮﻗﻭ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.REGOLITH.DESC"
msgid ""
"Regolith is a sandy substance composed of the various particles that collect atop terrestrial objects.\n"
"\n"
"It is useful as a <link=\"FILTER\">Filtration Medium</link>."
msgstr ""
".ﺔﻴﺿﺭﻷﺍ ﻡﺎﺴﺟﻷﺍ ﺢﻄﺳ ﻰﻠﻋ ﻊﻤﺠﺘﺗ ﻲﺘﻟﺍ ﺔﻔﻠﺘﺨﻤﻟﺍ ﺕﺎﻤﻴﺴﺠﻟﺍ ﻦﻣ ﻒﻟﺄﺘﺗ ﺔﻴﻠﻣﺭ ﺓﺩﺎﻣ ﻮﻫ ﺚﻴﻟﻮﻐﻳﺮﻟﺍ\n"
"\n"
" ـﻛ ﺪﻴﻔﻣ ﻮﻫ<link=\"FILTER\">ﺢﻴﺷﺮﺗ ﻂﺳﻭ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.REGOLITH.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"REGOLITH\">Regolith</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"REGOLITH\">ﻞﻠﺤﺘﻤﻟﺍ ﺮﺨﺼﻟﺍ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.RESIN.DESC"
msgid ""
"Sticky goo harvested from a grumpy tree.\n"
"\n"
"It can be polymerized into <link=\"ISORESIN\">Isosap</link> by boiling away its excess moisture."
msgstr ""
".ﺔﺒﺿﺎﻏ ﺓﺮﺠﺷ ﻦﻣ ﻩﺩﺎﺼﺣ ﻢﺘﻳ ﺝﺰﻟ ﻎﻤﺻ\n"
"\n"
" ﻰﻟﺇ ﻪﻠﻳﻮﺤﺗ ﻦﻜﻤﻳ<link=\"ISORESIN\">ﺏﺎﺳﻭﺰﻳﺇ</link>.ﺓﺪﺋﺍﺰﻟﺍ ﺔﺑﻮﻃﺮﻟﺍ ﺔﻟﺍﺯﻹ ﻪﻧﺎﻴﻠﻏ ﻖﻳﺮﻃ ﻦﻋ "

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.RESIN.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"RESIN\">Sap</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"RESIN\">ﻎﺴﻨﻟﺍ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ROCKGAS.DESC"
msgid ""
"Rock Gas is rock that has been superheated into a "
"<link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">Gaseous</link> state."
msgstr ""
" ﺔﻟﺎﺣ ﻰﻟﺇ ﺎﻬﻨﻴﺨﺴﺗ ﻢﺗ ﺓﺮﺨﺻ ﻮﻫ ﺭﻮﺨﺼﻟﺍ ﺯﺎﻏ<link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">ﺔﻳﺯﺎﻏ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ROCKGAS.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"ROCKGAS\">Rock Gas</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"ROCKGAS\">ﺯﺎﻏ ﻙﻭﺭ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.RUST.DESC"
msgid ""
"Rust is an iron oxide that forms from the breakdown of <link=\"IRON\">Iron</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It is useful in some <link=\"OXYGEN\">Oxygen</link> production processes."
msgstr ""
" ﻞﻠﺤﺗ ﻦﻣ ﻥﻮﻜﺘﻳ ﻱﺬﻟﺍ ﺪﻳﺪﺤﻟﺍ ﺪﻴﺴﻛﺃ ﻮﻫ ﺃﺪﺼﻟﺍ<link=\"IRON\">ﺪﻳﺪﺤﻟﺍ</link>.\n"
"\n"
" ﺝﺎﺘﻧﺇ ﺕﺎﻴﻠﻤﻋ ﺾﻌﺑ ﻲﻓ ﺪﻴﻔﻣ ﻮﻫﻭ<link=\"OXYGEN\">ﻦﻴﺠﺴﻛﻷﺍ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.RUST.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"RUST\">Rust</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"RUST\">ﺃﺪﺼﻟﺍ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.SALT.DESC"
msgid ""
"(NaCl) Salt, also known as sodium chloride, is an edible chemical compound.\n"
"\n"
"When refined, it can be eaten with meals to increase Duplicant <link=\"MORALE\">Morale</link>."
msgstr ""
"(NaCl) ﻞﻛﻸﻟ ﺢﻟﺎﺻ ﻲﺋﺎﻴﻤﻴﻛ ﺐﻛﺮﻣ ﻮﻫ ،ﻡﻮﻳﺩﻮﺼﻟﺍ ﺪﻳﺭﻮﻠﻛ ﻢﺳﺎﺑ ﺎﻀﻳﺃ ﻑﻭﺮﻌﻤﻟﺍ ،ﺢﻠﻤﻟﺍ.\n"
"\n"
" ﺓﺩﺎﻳﺰﻟ ﺕﺎﺒﺟﻮﻟﺍ ﻊﻣ ﻪﻟﻭﺎﻨﺗ ﻦﻜﻤﻳ ،ﻩﺮﻳﺮﻜﺗ ﺪﻨﻋ<link=\"MORALE\">ﺔﻳﻮﻨﻌﻤﻟﺍ ﺡﻭﺭ</link>.ﺔﻠﺛﺎﻤﺘﻤﻟﺍ ﺦﺴﻨﻠﻟ "

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.SALT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SALT\">Salt</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SALT\">ﺢﻠﻣ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.SALTGAS.DESC"
msgid ""
"(NaCl) Salt Gas is an edible chemical compound that has been superheated "
"into a <link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">Gaseous</link> state."
msgstr ""
"(NaCl) ﺔﻟﺎﺣ ﻲﻓ ﺢﺒﺼﻴﻟ ﺔﻴﻟﺎﻋ ﺓﺭﺍﺮﺣ ﺔﺟﺭﺩ ﻰﻟﺇ ﻪﻨﻴﺨﺴﺗ ﻢﺗ ﻞﻛﻸﻟ ﺢﻟﺎﺻ ﻲﺋﺎﻴﻤﻴﻛ ﺐﻛﺮﻣ "
"ﻮﻫ ﺢﻠﻤﻟﺍ ﺯﺎﻏ <link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">ﺔﻳﺯﺎﻏ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.SALTGAS.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SALTGAS\">Salt Gas</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SALTGAS\">ﺢﻠﻤﻟﺍ ﺯﺎﻏ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.SALTWATER.DESC"
msgid ""
"Salt Water is a natural, lightly concentrated solution of <link=\"SALT\">Salt</link> dissolved in <link=\"WATER\">Water</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It can be used in desalination processes, separating out usable salt."
msgstr ""
" ﻦﻣ ﺰﻴﻛﺮﺘﻟﺍ ﻞﻴﻠﻗ ،ﻲﻌﻴﺒﻃ ﻝﻮﻠﺤﻣ ﻮﻫ ﺢﻟﺎﻤﻟﺍ ﺀﺎﻤﻟﺍ<link=\"SALT\">ﺢﻠﻤﻟﺍ</link> ﻲﻓ ﺏﺍﺬﻤﻟﺍ <link=\"WATER\">ﺀﺎﻤﻟﺍ</link>.\n"
"\n"
".ﻡﺍﺪﺨﺘﺳﻼﻟ ﺢﻟﺎﺼﻟﺍ ﺢﻠﻤﻟﺍ ﻞﺼﻔﻟ ،ﺔﻴﻠﺤﺘﻟﺍ ﺕﺎﻴﻠﻤﻋ ﻲﻓ ﻪﻣﺍﺪﺨﺘﺳﺍ ﻦﻜﻤﻳ"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.SALTWATER.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SALTWATER\">Salt Water</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SALTWATER\">ﺢﻟﺎﻣ ﺀﺎﻣ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.SAND.DESC"
msgid ""
"Sand is a composite of granular rock.\n"
"\n"
"It is useful as a <link=\"FILTER\">Filtration Medium</link>."
msgstr ""
".ﺔﻴﺒﻴﺒﺤﻟﺍ ﺭﻮﺨﺼﻟﺍ ﻦﻣ ﺐﻛﺮﻣ ﻮﻫ ﻞﻣﺮﻟﺍ\n"
"\n"
" ـﻛ ﺪﻴﻔﻣ ﻪﻧﺇ<link=\"FILTER\">ﺢﻴﺷﺮﺗ ﻂﺳﻭ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.SAND.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SAND\">Sand</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SAND\">ﻞﻣﺭ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.SANDCEMENT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SANDCEMENT\">Sand Cement</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SANDCEMENT\">ﺖﻨﻤﺳﺇ ﻞﻣﺭ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.SANDSTONE.DESC"
msgid ""
"Sandstone is a composite of relatively soft sedimentary rock.\n"
"\n"
"It is useful as a <b>Construction Material</b>."
msgstr ""
".ﺎﻴﺒﺴﻧ ﺔﻤﻋﺎﻨﻟﺍ ﺔﻴﺑﻮﺳﺮﻟﺍ ﺭﻮﺨﺼﻟﺍ ﻦﻣ ﺞﻳﺰﻣ ﻮﻫ ﻲﻠﻣﺮﻟﺍ ﺮﺠﺤﻟﺍ\n"
"\n"
" ﺓﺩﺎﻤﻛ ﺪﻴﻔﻣ ﻪﻧﺇ<b>ﺀﺎﻨﺒﻠﻟ</b>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.SANDSTONE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SANDSTONE\">Sandstone</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SANDSTONE\">ﻲﻠﻣﺭ ﺮﺠﺣ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.SEDIMENTARYROCK.DESC"
msgid ""
"Sedimentary Rock is a hardened composite of sediment layers.\n"
"\n"
"It is useful as a <b>Construction Material</b>."
msgstr ""
".ﺐﺳﺍﻭﺮﻟﺍ ﺕﺎﻘﺒﻃ ﻦﻣ ﺐﻠﺼﺘﻣ ﺐﻛﺮﻣ ﻮﻫ ﺐﺳﺍﻭﺮﻟﺍ ﺮﺨﺼﻟﺍ\n"
"\n"
" ـﻛ ﺪﻴﻔﻣ ﻪﻧﺇ<b>ﺀﺎﻨﺑ ﺓﺩﺎﻣ</b>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.SEDIMENTARYROCK.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SEDIMENTARYROCK\">Sedimentary Rock</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SEDIMENTARYROCK\">ﻲﺑﻮﺳﺮﻟﺍ ﺮﺨﺼﻟﺍ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.SHALE.DESC"
msgid ""
"Shale is a brittle composite of sediment layers.\n"
"\n"
"It is useful as a <b>Construction Material</b>."
msgstr ""
".ﺐﺳﺍﻭﺮﻟﺍ ﺕﺎﻘﺒﻃ ﻦﻣ ﺶﻫ ﺐﻛﺮﻣ ﻮﻫ ﻲﺘﻳﺰﻟﺍ ﺮﺨﺼﻟﺍ\n"
"\n"
" ﺓﺩﺎﻤﻛ ﻡﺪﺨﺘﺴﻳ<b>ﺀﺎﻨﺒﻟ</b>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.SHALE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SHALE\">Shale</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SHALE\">ﻲﺘﻳﺰﻟﺍ ﺮﺨﺼﻟﺍ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.SLABS.DESC"
msgid ""
"Slabs are a refined mineral building block used for assembling advanced "
"buildings."
msgstr ""
".ﺔﻣﺪﻘﺘﻤﻟﺍ ﻲﻧﺎﺒﻤﻟﺍ ﻊﻴﻤﺠﺗ ﻲﻓ ﻡﺪﺨﺘﺴﺗ ﺔﻟﻮﻘﺼﻣ ﺔﻴﻧﺪﻌﻣ ﺀﺎﻨﺑ ﺓﺪﺣﻭ ﻦﻋ ﺓﺭﺎﺒﻋ ﻲﻫ ﺡﺍﻮﻟﻷﺍ"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.SLABS.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SLABS\">Building Slab</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SLABS\">ﻰﻨﺒﻤﻟﺍ ﺔﻃﻼﺑ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.SLIMEMOLD.DESC"
msgid ""
"Slime is a thick biomixture of algae, fungi, and mucopolysaccharides.\n"
"\n"
"It can be distilled into <link=\"ALGAE\">Algae</link> and emits <link=\"CONTAMINATEDOXYGEN\">Polluted Oxygen</link> once dug up."
msgstr ""
".ﺕﺍﺪﻳﺭﺎﻜﺴﻴﻟﻮﺑﻮﻛﻮﻴﻤﻟﺍﻭ ،ﺕﺎﻳﺮﻄﻔﻟﺍﻭ ،ﺐﻟﺎﺤﻄﻟﺍ ﻦﻣ ﻱﻮﻴﺣ ﻒﻴﺜﻛ ﻂﻴﻠﺧ ﻲﻫ ﺔﻘﻠﺣﺰﻟﺍ\n"
"\n"
" ﻰﻟﺇ ﺎﻫﺮﻴﻄﻘﺗ ﻦﻜﻤﻳ<link=\"ALGAE\">ﺐﻟﺎﺤﻃ</link> ﻖﻠﻄﺗﻭ <link=\"CONTAMINATEDOXYGEN\">ﺙﻮﻠﻤﻟﺍ ﻦﻴﺠﺴﻛﻷﺍ</link>.ﺎﻬﺟﺍﺮﺨﺘﺳﺍ ﺪﻨﻋ "

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.SLIMEMOLD.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SLIMEMOLD\">Slime</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SLIMEMOLD\">ﻲﻠﻴﺠﻟﺍ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.SNOW.DESC"
msgid ""
"(H<sub>2</sub>O) Snow is a mass of loose, crystalline ice particles.\n"
"\n"
"It becomes <link=\"WATER\">Water</link> when melted."
msgstr ""
"(H<sub>2</sub>O) ﺔﺿﺎﻔﻀﻔﻟﺍ ﺔﻳﺭﻮﻠﺒﻟﺍ ﺪﻴﻠﺠﻟﺍ ﺕﯫﻳﺰﺟ ﻦﻣ ﺔﻠﺘﻛ ﻮﻫ ﺞﻠﺜﻟﺍ.\n"
"\n"
" ﺢﺒﺼﻳ<link=\"WATER\">ﺀﺎﻣ</link>.ﻪﻧﺎﺑﻭﺫ ﺪﻨﻋ "

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.SNOW.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SNOW\">Snow</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SNOW\">ﺞﻠﺛ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.SOLIDCARBONDIOXIDE.DESC"
msgid ""
"(CO<sub>2</sub>) Carbon Dioxide is an unbreathable compound in a "
"<link=\"ELEMENTSSOLID\">Solid</link> state."
msgstr ""
"(CO<sub>2</sub> ﺔﻟﺎﺣ ﻲﻓ ﻪﻴﻓ ﺲﻔﻨﺘﻟﺍ ﻦﻜﻤﻳ ﻻ ﺐﻛﺮﻣ ﻮﻫ ﻥﻮﺑﺮﻜﻟﺍ ﺪﻴﺴﻛﺃ ﻲﻧﺎﺛ "
"(<link=\"ELEMENTSSOLID\">ﺔﺒﻠﺻ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.SOLIDCARBONDIOXIDE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SOLIDCARBONDIOXIDE\">Solid Carbon Dioxide</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SOLIDCARBONDIOXIDE\">ﺐﻠﺼﻟﺍ ﻥﻮﺑﺮﻜﻟﺍ ﺪﻴﺴﻛﺃ ﻲﻧﺎﺛ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.SOLIDCHLORINE.DESC"
msgid ""
"(Cl) Chlorine is a natural <link=\"DISEASE\">Germ</link>-killing element in "
"a <link=\"ELEMENTSSOLID\">Solid</link> state."
msgstr ""
"(Cl) ﺔﻟﺎﺣ ﻲﻓ ﻲﻌﻴﺒﻃ ﻢﻴﺛﺍﺮﺠﻠﻟ ﻞﺗﺎﻗ ﺮﺼﻨﻋ ﻮﻫ ﺭﻮﻠﻜﻟﺍ "
"<link=\"ELEMENTSSOLID\">ﺔﺒﻠﺻ</link>."

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.SOLIDCHLORINE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SOLIDCHLORINE\">Solid Chlorine</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SOLIDCHLORINE\">ﺐﻠﺼﻟﺍ ﺭﻮﻠﻜﻟﺍ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.SOLIDCRUDEOIL.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SOLIDCRUDEOIL\">Solid Crude Oil</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SOLIDCRUDEOIL\">ﺐﻠﺼﻟﺍ ﻡﺎﺨﻟﺍ ﻂﻔﻨﻟﺍ</link>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.SOLIDETHANOL.DESC"
msgid ""
"(C<sub>2</sub>H<sub>6</sub>O) Solid Ethanol is an advanced chemical compound.\n"
"\n"
"It can be used as a highly effective fuel source when burned."
