msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.TEMPCONDUCTORSOLID.DESC"
msgid ""
"Thermium is an industrial metal alloy formulated to maximize "
"<link=\"HEAT\">Heat Transfer</link> and thermal dispersion."
msgstr ""
" ﻢﻴﻈﻌﺘﻟ ﺔﻤﻤﺼﻣ ﺔﻴﻋﺎﻨﺻ ﺔﻴﻧﺪﻌﻣ ﺔﻜﻴﺒﺳ ﻮﻫ ﻡﻮﻴﻣﺮﻴﺛ<link=\"HEAT\">ﺓﺭﺍﺮﺤﻟﺍ "
"ﻞﻘﻧ</link>.ﻱﺭﺍﺮﺤﻟﺍ ﺖﺘﺸﺘﻟﺍﻭ "

