msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.ANTIHISTAMINE.RECIPEDESC"
msgid ""
"A strong antihistamine Duplicants can take to halt an allergic reaction. "
"<link=\"ANTIHISTAMINE\">Allergy Medication</link> will also prevent further "
"reactions from occurring for a short time after ingestion."
msgstr ""
" .ﻲﺴﺴﺤﺗ ﻞﻌﻓ ﺩﺭ ﻒﻗﻮﻟ ﻩﺬﺧﺃ ﺦﺴﻨﻠﻟ ﻦﻜﻤﻳ ﻱﻮﻗ ﻦﻴﻣﺎﺘﺴﻴﻫ "
"ﺩﺎﻀﻣ<link=\"ANTIHISTAMINE\">ﺔﻴﺳﺎﺴﺤﻟﺍ ﺀﺍﻭﺩ</link>.ﻝﻭﺎﻨﺘﻟﺍ ﺪﻌﺑ ﺓﺮﻴﺼﻗ ﺓﺮﺘﻔﻟ "
"ﻯﺮﺧﺃ ﻞﻌﻓ ﺩﻭﺩﺭ ﺙﻭﺪﺣ ﺎﻀﻳﺃ ﻊﻨﻤﻴﺳ "

