msgctxt "STRINGS.MISC.NOTIFICATIONS.BADROCKETPATH.TOOLTIP"
msgid ""
"A rocket's flight path has been interrupted by a new astronomical discovery.\n"
"Open the <style=\"KKeyword\">Starmap Screen</style> {Hotkey/ManageStarmap} to reassign rocket paths"
msgstr ""
".ﺪﻳﺪﺟ ﻲﻜﻠﻓ ﻑﺎﺸﺘﻛﺍ ﺐﺒﺴﺑ ﺥﻭﺭﺎﺼﻟﺍ ﺔﻠﺣﺭ ﺭﺎﺴﻣ ﻊﻄﻗ ﻢﺗ\n"
" ﺢﺘﻓﺍ<style=\"KKeyword\">ﻡﻮﺠﻨﻟﺍ ﺔﻄﻳﺮﺧ ﺔﺷﺎﺷ</style>ﺦﻳﺭﺍﻮﺼﻟﺍ ﺕﺍﺭﺎﺴﻣ ﻦﻴﻴﻌﺗ ﺓﺩﺎﻋﻹ {Hotkey/ManageStarmap} "

msgctxt "STRINGS.MISC.NOTIFICATIONS.BASICCONTROLS.MESSAGEBODY"
msgid ""
"• I can use {Hotkey/PanLeft} and {Hotkey/PanRight} to pan my view left and right, and {Hotkey/PanUp} and {Hotkey/PanDown} to pan up and down.\n"
"\n"
"• {Hotkey/ZoomIn} lets me zoom in, and {Hotkey/ZoomOut} zooms out.\n"
"\n"
"• {Hotkey/CameraHome} returns my view to the Printing Pod.\n"
"\n"
"• I can speed or slow my perception of time using the top left corner buttons, or by pressing {Hotkey/SpeedUp} or {Hotkey/SlowDown}. Pressing {Hotkey/TogglePause} will pause the flow of time entirely.\n"
"\n"
"• I'll keep records of everything I discover in my personal DATABASE {Hotkey/ManageDatabase} to refer back to if I forget anything important."
msgstr ""
".ﻞﻔﺳﻷﺍﻭ ﻰﻠﻋﻸﻟ ﺎﻬﻜﻳﺮﺤﺘﻟ {Hotkey/PanLeft} ﻭ {Hotkey/PanRight} ﻭ ،ﻦﻴﻤﻴﻟﺍﻭ ﺭﺎﺴﻴﻟﺍ ﻰﻟﺇ ﻲﺘﻳﺅﺭ ﻚﻳﺮﺤﺘﻟ {Hotkey/PanUp} ﻭ {Hotkey/PanDown} ﻡﺍﺪﺨﺘﺳﺍ ﻊﻴﻄﺘﺳﺃ •\n"
"\n"
"• {Hotkey/ZoomIn} ﻭ ،ﺮﻴﺒﻜﺘﻟﺎﺑ ﻲﻟ ﺢﻤﺴﻳ {Hotkey/ZoomOut} ﺮﻴﻐﺼﺘﻠﻟ.\n"
"\n"
"• {Hotkey/CameraHome} ﺔﻋﺎﺒﻄﻟﺍ ﺓﺪﺣﻭ ﻰﻟﺇ ﻲﺘﻳﺅﺭ ﺪﻴﻌﻳ.\n"
"\n"
".ﻞﻣﺎﻜﻟﺎﺑ ﺖﻗﻮﻟﺍ ﻖﻓﺪﺗ ﻒﻗﻮﻴﺳ {Hotkey/SpeedUp} ﻰﻠﻋ ﻂﻐﻀﻟﺍ .{Hotkey/SlowDown} ﻭﺃ {Hotkey/TogglePause} ﻰﻠﻋ ﻂﻐﻀﻟﺎﺑ ﻭﺃ ،ﻯﺮﺴﻴﻟﺍ ﺔﻳﻮﻠﻌﻟﺍ ﺔﻳﻭﺍﺰﻟﺍ ﻲﻓ ﺭﺍﺭﺯﻷﺍ ﻡﺍﺪﺨﺘﺳﺎﺑ ﺖﻗﻮﻠﻟ ﻲﻛﺍﺭﺩﺇ ﺀﺎﻄﺑﺇ ﻭﺃ ﻊﻳﺮﺴﺗ ﻊﻴﻄﺘﺳﺃ •\n"
"\n"
".ﻢﻬﻣ ﺀﻲﺷ ﻱﺃ ﺖﻴﺴﻧ ﺍﺫﺇ ﺎﻬﻴﻟﺇ ﻉﻮﺟﺮﻠﻟ {Hotkey/ManageDatabase} ﺔﻴﺼﺨﺸﻟﺍ ﻲﺗﺎﻧﺎﻴﺑ ﺓﺪﻋﺎﻗ ﻲﻓ ﻪﻔﺸﺘﻛﺃ ﺎﻣ ﻞﻛ ﺕﻼﺠﺴﺑ ﻆﻔﺘﺣﺄﺳ •"

msgctxt "STRINGS.MISC.NOTIFICATIONS.BASICCONTROLS.MESSAGEBODYALT"
msgid ""
"• I can use {Hotkey/AnalogCamera} to pan my view.\n"
"\n"
"• {Hotkey/ZoomIn} lets me zoom in, and {Hotkey/ZoomOut} zooms out.\n"
"\n"
"• I can speed or slow my perception of time using the top left corner buttons, or by pressing {Hotkey/CycleSpeed}. Pressing {Hotkey/TogglePause} will pause the flow of time entirely.\n"
"\n"
"• I'll keep records of everything I discover in my personal DATABASE {Hotkey/ManageDatabase} to refer back to if I forget anything important."
msgstr ""
".ﻲﺘﻳﺅﺭ ﻚﻳﺮﺤﺘﻟ {Hotkey/AnalogCamera} ﻡﺍﺪﺨﺘﺳﺍ ﻲﻨﻨﻜﻤﻳ •\n"
"\n"
"• {Hotkey/ZoomIn} ﻭ ،ﺮﻴﺒﻜﺘﻟﺎﺑ ﻲﻟ ﺢﻤﺴﻳ {Hotkey/ZoomOut} ﺮﻴﻐﺼﺘﻟﺎﺑ ﻲﻟ ﺢﻤﺴﻳ.\n"
"\n"
".ﺎﻣﺎﻤﺗ ﺖﻗﻮﻟﺍ ﻖﻓﺪﺗ ﻒﻗﻮﻴﺳ {Hotkey/CycleSpeed} ﻰﻠﻋ ﻂﻐﻀﻟﺍ .{Hotkey/TogglePause} ﻰﻠﻋ ﻂﻐﻀﻟﺎﺑ ﻭﺃ ،ﻯﺮﺴﻴﻟﺍ ﺔﻳﻮﻠﻌﻟﺍ ﺔﻳﻭﺍﺰﻟﺍ ﻲﻓ ﺭﺍﺭﺯﻷﺍ ﻡﺍﺪﺨﺘﺳﺎﺑ ﺖﻗﻮﻠﻟ ﻲﻛﺍﺭﺩﺇ ﺀﺎﻄﺑﺇ ﻭﺃ ﻊﻳﺮﺴﺗ ﻲﻨﻨﻜﻤﻳ •\n"
"\n"
".ﻢﻬﻣ ﺀﻲﺷ ﻱﺃ ﺖﻴﺴﻧ ﺍﺫﺇ ﺎﻬﻴﻟﺇ ﻉﻮﺟﺮﻠﻟ {Hotkey/ManageDatabase} ﺔﻴﺼﺨﺸﻟﺍ ﻲﺗﺎﻧﺎﻴﺑ ﺓﺪﻋﺎﻗ ﻲﻓ ﻪﻔﺸﺘﻛﺃ ﺎﻣ ﻞﻜﻟ ﺕﻼﺠﺴﺑ ﻆﻔﺘﺣﺄﺳ •"

