msgctxt "STRINGS.MISC.NOTIFICATIONS.BIONICBATTERY.MESSAGEBODY"
msgid ""
"Bionic Duplicants require <link=\"ELECTROBANK\">Power Banks</link> to function. Bionic Duplicants who run out of <link=\"POWER\">Power</link> will become incapacitated and require another Duplicant to reboot them.\n"
"\n"
"Basic power banks can be made at the <link=\"CRAFTINGTABLE\">Crafting Station</link>."
msgstr ""
" ﺔﻴﻧﻮﻴﺒﻟﺍ ﺦﺴﻨﻟﺍ ﺐﻠﻄﺘﺗ<link=\"ELECTROBANK\">ﺔﻗﺎﻄﻟﺍ ﺕﺎﻳﺭﺎﻄﺑ</link> ﺎﻬﻨﻣ ﺪﻔﻨﺗ ﻲﺘﻟﺍ ﺔﻴﻧﻮﻴﺒﻟﺍ ﺦﺴﻨﻟﺍ .ﻞﻤﻌﻠﻟ <link=\"POWER\">ﺔﻗﺎﻄﻟﺍ</link>.ﺎﻬﻠﻴﻐﺸﺗ ﺓﺩﺎﻋﻹ ﻯﺮﺧﺃ ﺔﺨﺴﻧ ﻰﻟﺇ ﺝﺎﺘﺤﺗﻭ ﺓﺰﺟﺎﻋ ﺢﺒﺼﺘﺳ \n"
"\n"
" ﻲﻓ ﺔﻴﺳﺎﺳﻷﺍ ﺔﻗﺎﻄﻟﺍ ﺕﺎﻳﺭﺎﻄﺑ ﻊﻨﺻ ﻦﻜﻤﻳ<link=\"CRAFTINGTABLE\">ﻊﻴﻨﺼﺘﻟﺍ ﺔﻄﺤﻣ</link>."

