msgctxt "STRINGS.MISC.NOTIFICATIONS.DTU.MESSAGEBODY"
msgid ""
"My Duplicants measure heat energy in Duplicant Thermal Units or DTU.\n"
"\n"
"1 DTU = 1055.06 J"
msgstr ""
".DTU ﻭﺃ ﺭﺮﻜﻤﻠﻟ ﺔﻳﺭﺍﺮﺣ ﺕﺍﺪﺣﻮﺑ ﺔﻳﺭﺍﺮﺤﻟﺍ ﺔﻗﺎﻄﻟﺍ ﻱﺪﻟ ﻥﻭﺭﺮﻜﻤﻟﺍ ﺲﻴﻘﻳ\n"
