msgctxt "STRINGS.MISC.NOTIFICATIONS.MOPPINGMESSAGE.MESSAGEBODY"
msgid ""
"<link=\"DIRTYWATER\">Polluted Water</link> slowly emits <link=\"CONTAMINATEDOXYGEN\">Polluted Oxygen</link> which accelerates the spread of <link=\"DISEASE\">Disease</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Duplicants will also be <link=\"STRESS\">Stressed</link> by walking through Polluted Water, so I should have my Duplicants clean up spills by (ClickType/clicking) and dragging the <b>Mop Tool</b> {Hotkey/Mop}"
msgstr ""
"<link=\"DIRTYWATER\">ﺙﻮﻠﻤﻟﺍ ﺀﺎﻤﻟﺍ</link> ﺀﻂﺒﺑ ﻪﻨﻣ ﺚﻌﺒﻨﻳ <link=\"CONTAMINATEDOXYGEN\">ﺙﻮﻠﻤﻟﺍ ﻦﻴﺠﺴﻛﻷﺍ</link> ﺭﺎﺸﺘﻧﺍ ﻦﻣ ﻉﺮﺴﻳ ﻱﺬﻟﺍ <link=\"DISEASE\">ﺽﺍﺮﻣﻷﺍ</link>.\n"
"\n"
" ـﺑ ﺎﻀﻳﺃ Duplicantsﻝﺍ ﺮﻌﺸﻴﺳ<link=\"STRESS\">ﺮﺗﻮﺘﻟﺍ</link> ﺐﺤﺳﻭ (ﺮﻘﻨﻟﺍ/ClickType) ﻖﻳﺮﻃ ﻦﻋ ﺕﺎﺑﺎﻜﺴﻧﻻﺍ ﻥﻮﻔﻈﻨﻳ Duplicantsﻝﺍ ﻞﻌﺟﺃ ﻥﺃ ﻲﻠﻋ ﺐﺠﻳ ﻚﻟﺬﻟ ،ﺙﻮﻠﻤﻟﺍ ﺀﺎﻤﻟﺍ ﻲﻓ ﻲﺸﻤﻟﺍ ﺪﻨﻋ <b>ﺢﺴﻤﻟﺍ ﺓﺍﺩﺃ</b> {Hotkey/Mop}"

