"My Duplicants will only eat, sleep, work, or bathe during the times I allot for such activities.\n"
"\n"
"To make the best use of their time, I can open the <b>Schedule Tab</b> {Hotkey/ManageSchedule} to adjust the colony's schedule and plan how they should utilize their day."
msgstr ""
".ﺔﻄﺸﻧﻷﺍ ﻩﺬﻫ ﻞﺜﻤﻟ ﺎﻬﺼﺼﺧﺃ ﻲﺘﻟﺍ ﺕﺎﻗﻭﻷﺍ ﻝﻼﺧ ﻢﺤﺘﺴﻳ ﻭﺃ ﻞﻤﻌﻳ ﻭﺃ ﻡﺎﻨﻳ ﻭﺃ ﻻﺇ ﻲﺨﺴﻧ ﻞﻛﺄﻳ ﻦﻟ\n"
"\n"
