msgctxt "STRINGS.MISC.TAGS.PLASTIC_DESC"
msgid ""
"Plastics are synthetic <link=\"ELEMENTSSOLID\">Solids</link> that are "
"pliable and minimize the transfer of <link=\"HEAT\">Heat</link>. They "
"typically have a low melting point, although more advanced plastics have "
"been developed to circumvent this issue."
