msgid ""
"A sanctuary of personal hygiene.\n"
"\n"
"Using a fully plumbed Washroom will improve Duplicants' Morale."
msgstr ""
".ﺔﻴﺼﺨﺸﻟﺍ ﺔﻓﺎﻈﻨﻠﻟ ﺫﻼﻣ\n"
".ﻦﻴﻔﻳﺰﻤﻟﺍ ﺕﺎﻳﻮﻨﻌﻣ ﻦﺴﺤﻴﺳ ﻞﻣﺎﻜﻟﺎﺑ ﺰﻬﺠﻣ ﻡﺎﻤﺣ ﻡﺍﺪﺨﺘﺳﺍ"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.PLUMBEDBATHROOM.EFFECT"
msgid "- Morale bonus"
