msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.SPACEARTIFACTS.MOLDAVITE.ARTIFACT"
msgid ""
"This extremely rare, museum grade moldavite once sat on the desk of Dr. Ren Sato, but it was stolen by some unknown person.\n"
